/maitrungduc1410/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maitrungduc1410/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maitrungduc1410","id":16630193,"login":"maitrungduc1410","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjMwMTkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maitrungduc1410/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maitrungduc1410/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maitrungduc1410/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maitrungduc1410/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maitrungduc1410/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maitrungduc1410","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maitrungduc1410/maitrungduc1410/commits/6fe9a212e9445eda1fd72bbda2934659199034fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T14:31:46Z","email":"maitrungduc1410@gmail.com","name":"Duc Trung Mai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T14:31:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(profile): promote vivari and tidy the project list\n\nReorder the \"Selected open-source work\" table so vivari leads. It is the\nmost substantial and most broadly interesting project of the set: an\nMIT-licensed WebContainer that runs Node projects entirely in the\nbrowser, which is a stronger opener than a component library.\n\nMove react-native-zalo-kit out of the table and down into \"Also in the\nworkshop\". Of the original five it is the narrowest in audience, and the\ntable stays at five entries with vivari taking its place.\n\nAlso smooth out the phrasing of a few sentences in the README copy, and\nmake the punctuation of the workshop list consistent with it. No\nstructural, layout or workflow changes.\n\nREADME.md is regenerated from README.tmpl.md so the two stay in sync.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"5290474e78f3e851a584a62a9302e9b525a0dd3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maitrungduc1410/maitrungduc1410/git/trees/5290474e78f3e851a584a62a9302e9b525a0dd3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maitrungduc1410/maitrungduc1410/git/commits/6fe9a212e9445eda1fd72bbda2934659199034fb","verification":{"payload":"tree 5290474e78f3e851a584a62a9302e9b525a0dd3c\nparent aecc0fb9e58ba15c35d82f4c94875e3069873b9c\nauthor Duc Trung Mai <maitrungduc1410@gmail.com> 1785594706 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785594706 +0800\n\nfeat(profile): promote vivari and tidy the project list\n\nReorder the \"Selected open-source work\" table so vivari leads. It is the\nmost substantial and most broadly interesting project of the set: an\nMIT-licensed WebContainer that runs Node projects entirely in the\nbrowser, which is a stronger opener than a component library.\n\nMove react-native-zalo-kit out of the table and down into \"Also in the\nworkshop\". Of the original five it is the narrowest in audience, and the\ntable stays at five entries with vivari taking its place.\n\nAlso smooth out the phrasing of a few sentences in the README copy, and\nmake the punctuation of the workshop list consistent with it. No\nstructural, layout or workflow changes.\n\nREADME.md is regenerated from README.tmpl.md so the two stay in sync.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbgNTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9ukQAE56iPEIN6R5kZoLwRfs26Nz\nfYsMuLzO+G2oJvU3qDcndmaN55zg0bvwtvfySY5YXt6BeF9k4cgsNKEhv0M4x2WY\nc++Fa3XMl3pGTVjOGeqOm5cVadqfMlSS8SxNknd3d1ZblC4A8kh8MLLYugumoxTs\nk2daVBGP7bgPmRcmV491PzcEmGOIoYkXRQaXS0D7XeE+/7bUi1DLJRGrGRV5TWDf\naUmipqf5x3yrVkXEqvCJwmmg6jj0SO/zlz6GHV9RER2sJb6RDtfKhyOqTRHbnG35\nGTI8rxBf+mz86XUkw/cFWy2PRFWiaVyVvbgX9CB+L0EbcxO05VgUgxKSBdvW1Ygf\noVFGIW/0pJvpvM7qZ91o26U1gtVvIHANQQJPfQ+D/PkrQWf5bhYzmxRHgwA0pcj9\nCdIqZE1MmI38ZUPDiK8zsmHl/u5PfpWsO6GT55qUmULK8nYbygvbyYPRnyuHCZT7\nm85yZ5IE6wh8huay/aFr5qEHsWx/rRKE8IRzGl3dxrG