,"email":"71225455+DylanBrass@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dylan Brassard"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-25T01:02:23Z","committedDate":"2026-08-25T01:02:23Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T17:44:13.932Z","repositoryId":394755539,"sha":"c456dd549b7b381b722d0365de8e64d065550598"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"DylanBrass","providerType":"User"},"email":"71225455+DylanBrass@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dylan Brassard"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-21T01:24:42Z","committedDate":"2026-08-21T01:24:42Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T17:44:13.932Z","repositoryId":394755539,"sha":"30491d6ca50aa6c175921f61cc291ba5b00078be"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"DylanBrass","providerType":"User"},"email":"71225455+DylanBrass@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dylan Brassard"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-20T23:47:59Z","committedDate":"2026-08-20T23:47:59Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T17:44:13.932Z","repositoryId":394755539,"sha":"4f5bd4b5eda8f03c69a17173320ade97f0298838"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"DylanBrass","providerType":"User"},"email":"71225455+DylanBrass@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dylan Brassard"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-19T23:05:55Z","committedDate":"2026-08-19T23:05:55Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T17:44:13.932Z","repositoryId":394755539,"sha":"cd34e8fee4089e5aa37c315ad48bf2a4c85a3c38"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T17:44:13.932Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167229698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AarushP06","id":167229698,"login":"AarushP06","node_id":"U_kgDOCfe5Ag","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/3b5ca4c3562a550b22efcd2d6c91a2a1d302190a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:28:50Z","email":"167229698+AarushP06@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AarushP06"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:28:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(PROD-CPC-2081): add delete product button to Angular employee portal (#1576)\n\n**JIRA:**\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/PROD-CPC-2081\n\n  ## Context:\nThis PR adds product deletion to the new Angular employee portal.\nAuthorized users can delete products after confirmation, with special\nhandling when a product belongs to one or more bundles.\n\n  ## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo. This PR does not modify the `.vscode` folder in\n`petclinic-frontend`.\n\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n  ## Changes\n\n- Added a Delete button to Product cards for `ADMIN` and\n`INVENTORY_MANAGER`.\n  - Added a reusable Product Delete confirmation dialog.\n  - Added a second confirmation when a product belongs to bundles.\n- Added deletion with `cascadeBundles=false` and retry with\n`cascadeBundles=true`.\n  - Added ProductService delete support in `employee-frontend`.\n  - Added 404 and 409 error mapping in `ProductsServiceClient`.\n  - Added error handling so failed deletions keep the product visible.\n  - Refreshes the Product List after successful deletion.\n- Improved Product card action button spacing, alignment, and\ndestructive styling.\n- Added tests for deletion, confirmation, bundle conflicts, API\nparameters, and error handling.\n\n  ## Does this use the v2 API?:\n\n  No. This PR uses the existing v1 Product API.\n\n  ## Does this add a new communication between services?:\n\nNo. It uses the existing communication flow between `employee-frontend`,\n`api-gateway`, and `products-service`.\n\n  ## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n\n  Before:\n  - Product cards did not have a Delete button.\n<img width=\"1679\" height=\"877\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55c5fdd3-9bae-41fe-bbab-b2e37a6aebc1\"\n/>\n\n\n  After:\n  - Product cards include a Delete button for authorized roles.\n  \n<img width=\"1679\" height=\"917\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ba21449-17fd-4d47-938c-1d9fee338947\"\n/>\n\n  - Delete confirmation dialogs are displayed before deletion.\n \n<img width=\"1679\" height=\"909\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6009bd65-9092-4c2e-8e6f-ec8d0f2e61eb\"\n/>\n\n  - Bundle-related deletion warnings are displayed when applicable.\n  \n<img width=\"1679\" height=\"912\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/31958a3f-e266-4b01-b9a4-a78d2197adaa\"\n/>\n\n  - Product action buttons are aligned and spaced consistently.\n\n  ## Dev notes\n\n  - Products are first deleted with `cascadeBundles=false`.\n  - A 409 Conflict opens a second confirmation dialog.\n  - Confirming the second dialog retries with `cascadeBundles=true`.\n  - Product List refreshes using the existing `loadProducts()` method.\n  - Angular Product tests passed: 26 tests.\n  - Angular lint passed.\n- No backend database or frontend application outside the requested\nscope was modified.\n\n  ## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n\n  None.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Nathan Bessette <123912175+NateDev5@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6099d6fe3bb7b9dbe5e63ed71ebb7800094c8be4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/6099d6fe3bb7b9dbe5e63ed71ebb7800094c8be4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/3b5ca4c3562a550b22efcd2d6c91a2a1d302190a","verification":{"payload":"tree 6099d6fe3bb7b9dbe5e63ed71ebb7800094c8be4\nparent b8b7aa9f9234bfab9f6eae352b16eb8c90573ae0\nauthor AarushP06 <167229698+AarushP06@users.noreply.github.com> 1791469730 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791469730 -0400\n\nfeat(PROD-CPC-2081): add delete product button to Angular employee portal (#1576)\n\n**JIRA:**\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/PROD-CPC-2081\n\n  ## Context:\nThis PR adds product deletion to the new Angular employee portal.\nAuthorized users can delete products after confirmation, with special\nhandling when a product belongs to one or more bundles.\n\n  ## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo. This PR does not modify the `.vscode` folder in\n`petclinic-frontend`.\n\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n  ## Changes\n\n- Added a Delete button to Product cards for `ADMIN` and\n`INVENTORY_MANAGER`.\n  - Added a reusable Product Delete confirmation dialog.\n  - Added a second confirmation when a product belongs to bundles.\n- Added deletion with `cascadeBundles=false` and retry with\n`cascadeBundles=true`.\n  - Added ProductService delete support in `employee-frontend`.\n  - Added 404 and 409 error mapping in `ProductsServiceClient`.\n  - Added error handling so failed deletions keep the product visible.\n  - Refreshes the Product List after successful deletion.\n- Improved Product card action button spacing, alignment, and\ndestructive styling.\n- Added tests for deletion, confirmation, bundle conflicts, API\nparameters, and error handling.\n\n  ## Does this use the v2 API?:\n\n  No. This PR uses the existing v1 Product API.\n\n  ## Does this add a new communication between services?:\n\nNo. It uses the existing communication flow between `employee-frontend`,\n`api-gateway`, and `products-service`.\n\n  ## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n\n  Before:\n  - Product cards did not have a Delete button.\n<img width=\"1679\" height=\"877\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55c5fdd3-9bae-41fe-bbab-b2e37a6aebc1\"\n/>\n\n\n  After:\n  - Product cards include a Delete button for authorized roles.\n  \n<img width=\"1679\" height=\"917\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ba21449-17fd-4d47-938c-1d9fee338947\"\n/>\n\n  - Delete confirmation dialogs are displayed before deletion.\n \n<img width=\"1679\" height=\"909\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6009bd65-9092-4c2e-8e6f-ec8d0f2e61eb\"\n/>\n\n  - Bundle-related deletion warnings are displayed when applicable.\n  \n<img width=\"1679\" height=\"912\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/31958a3f-e266-4b01-b9a4-a78d2197adaa\"\n/>\n\n  - Product action buttons are aligned and spaced consistently.\n\n  ## Dev notes\n\n  - Products are first deleted with `cascadeBundles=false`.\n  - A 409 Conflict opens a second confirmation dialog.\n  - Confirming the second dialog retries with `cascadeBundles=true`.\n  - Product List refreshes using the existing `loadProducts()` method.\n  - Angular Product tests passed: 26 tests.\n  - Angular lint passed.\n- No backend database or frontend application outside the requested\nscope was modified.\n\n  ## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n\n  None.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Nathan Bessette <123912175+NateDev5@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx6iiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3TAQAIQqI0t//ToSJeVqTnbnATW3\n5dcE791Df6yRR7siGASd6NPkIGcwQ1okIhAs6z5bPZH73fpIz5/vDxi5cP8JAhND\nLMv+sB/FjCO83oeVvigmgx6oIOpsw/OgE3oJ+y/al6/jdzzLlmsjGtDwP8em3mn2\nowgDwNpC+kdJCOqj2XygMoycQfzvOfwL49EX5spfJEOdFNr7JrvlJMKSs8qxEPli\nIOd8RgaW9vMU3yjszPV2IwEKPn76VNHWW50X0EGX+eGAsviAIP3tVZ9Q3UcZTd95\n30/WX+yZSfNcWWpwKelxjvGclPeUcpAhUXMRJNuKOT66lIFxWwaZgtMGtYdevziz\nw3r+ZLuHzy1QE8DR1VuWMmNJkCPtafSuclt3d8r6jUlETwtt2vYr1qbk1MpgRfxZ\nmQNWIVIZ1KaPu7zMW8HKF7iSTdF5hjyIQzARgdcfYzmgzOnk8r/dSTa4JjDqMxFL\nUoq+jwa8kZGEQ/uunVHz67XFtZOjxdbv9wsv5nOtT929O4ZYrMfHjuR+HupNNgC6\nvWdpJgYXlfVnVxa5bDlL3m/B/blsF5MZdXZSlistOtfAelN+j2GVNw5nR0vcQcJv\njdJfqsLOhBwfOCkqjQZz4WL5nIXiND7D23nL01TCKJrqsQ5mHLTCqSY/bjeSiim4\nMyoIOUMDFSbiaVGQgeod\n=K/40\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T14:28:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commit/3b5ca4c3562a550b22efcd2d6c91a2a1d302190a","node_id":"C_kwDOF4d909oAKDNiNWNhNGMzNTYyYTU1MGIyMmVmY2QyZDZjOTFhMmExZDMwMjE5MGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commit/b8b7aa9f9234bfab9f6eae352b16eb8c90573ae0","sha":"b8b7aa9f9234bfab9f6eae352b16eb8c90573ae0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/b8b7aa9f9234bfab9f6eae352b16eb8c90573ae0"}],"sha":"3b5ca4c3562a550b22efcd2d6c91a2a1d302190a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/3b5ca4c3562a550b22efcd2d6c91a2a1d302190a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190225860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marwamesk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marwamesk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marwamesk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marwamesk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marwamesk","id":190225860,"login":"marwamesk","node_id":"U_kgDOC1adxA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marwamesk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marwamesk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marwamesk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marwamesk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marwamesk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marwamesk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/b8b7aa9f9234bfab9f6eae352b16eb8c90573ae0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:50:04Z","email":"maroumes12@hotmail.com","name":"marwamesk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:50:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(VIST-CPC-2046): Allow Vets & Admin to View the Visits in the Employee Portal (#1587)\n\n**JIRA:** https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-2046\n\n## **Context**\n\nCurrently, a vet cannot view their own visits in the employee portal.\nThey need to be able to view their visits. An admin also needs to be\nable to view all visits in the pet clinic.\n\n## **Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?**\n\nNo.\n\n## **Changes**\n\n* Created the VistListTable.ts, VistListTable.html, and\nVistListTable.css components to display a visits table at /vist in the\nemployee frontend.\n* Added a visit service to communicate with the backend and retrieve\nvisits based on the authenticated user''s role:\n\n  * For an **Admin**, getAllVisits is called to retrieve all visits.\n* For a **Vet**, getVisitsByPractitionerId is called to retrieve only\ntheir visits.\n* Added interfaces to the models folder to represent the visit\ninformation displayed in the table.\n\n## **Does this use the v2 API?**\n\nNo.\n\n## **Does this add a new communication between services?**\n\nNo.\n\n## **Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)**\nBefore:\n<img width=\"1511\" height=\"936\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-07 at 21 00 54\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/196785ae-bc0d-4dcd-8d0d-5b1715023370\"\n/>\n\nAfter: \nFor a vet -\n<img width=\"1511\" height=\"828\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-07 at 20 42 41\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75252945-00e1-449e-af66-bf79b9b12701\"\n/>\n\nFor the admin -\n<img width=\"1511\" height=\"936\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-07 at 21 11 17\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/011ea816-a7cc-49da-aba3-d3f952a32676\"\n/>\n\nThis PR changes the employee portal UI by adding a visits table that\nallows admins to view all visits and vets to view their own visits.\n\n## **Dev Notes (Optional)**\n\nThe following Playwright end-to-end tests were added and passed:\n\n* visitListVetVisits.spec.ts\n* visitListAdmin.spec.ts\n\n**2 tests passed**\n\n## **Linked Pull Requests (Optional)**\n\nNone.","tree":{"sha":"99d655ec281cd0e8ed5196a8100333ad04c80c5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/99d655ec281cd0e8ed5196a8100333ad04c80c5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/b8b7aa9f9234bfab9f6eae352b16eb8c90573ae0","verification":{"payload":"tree 99d655ec281cd0e8ed5196a8100333ad04c80c5d\nparent 696edf6a476aeea40d0bfdd213a7e52509d0a9a8\nauthor marwamesk <maroumes12@hotmail.com> 1791431404 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791431404 -0400\n\nfeat(VIST-CPC-2046): Allow Vets & Admin to View the Visits in the Employee Portal (#1587)\n\n**JIRA:** https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-2046\n\n## **Context**\n\nCurrently, a vet cannot view their own visits in the employee portal.\nThey need to be able to view their visits. An admin also needs to be\nable to view all visits in the pet clinic.\n\n## **Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?**\n\nNo.\n\n## **Changes**\n\n* Created the VistListTable.ts, VistListTable.html, and\nVistListTable.css components to display a visits table at /vist in the\nemployee frontend.\n* Added a visit service to communicate with the backend and retrieve\nvisits based on the authenticated user''s role:\n\n  * For an **Admin**, getAllVisits is called to retrieve all visits.\n* For a **Vet**, getVisitsByPractitionerId is called to retrieve only\ntheir visits.\n* Added interfaces to the models folder to represent the visit\ninformation displayed in the table.\n\n## **Does this use the v2 API?**\n\nNo.\n\n## **Does this add a new communication between services?**\n\nNo.\n\n## **Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)**\nBefore:\n<img width=\"1511\" height=\"936\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-07 at 21 00 54\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/196785ae-bc0d-4dcd-8d0d-5b1715023370\"\n/>\n\nAfter: \nFor a vet -\n<img width=\"1511\" height=\"828\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-07 at 20 42 41\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75252945-00e1-449e-af66-bf79b9b12701\"\n/>\n\nFor the admin -\n<img width=\"1511\" height=\"936\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-07 at 21 11 17\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/011ea816-a7cc-49da-aba3-d3f952a32676\"\n/>\n\nThis PR changes the employee portal UI by adding a visits table that\nallows admins to view all visits and vets to view their own visits.\n\n## **Dev Notes (Optional)**\n\nThe following Playwright end-to-end tests were added and passed:\n\n* visitListVetVisits.spec.ts\n* visitListAdmin.spec.ts\n\n**2 tests passed**\n\n## **Linked Pull Requests (Optional)**\n\nNone.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxxLsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA19cQAK6iTOKXL/N48/V+APhWTQlT\nL/YljkK6lo8IbJ0PaselTQt4wjzt0bRXl5VNY5Z/0PPHB7P90XAmXpkoKsVxyj8k\neCw3+9C88hboRJPDh4e4XMYwCcgr+dNU/Obv+auLRNEfg7uwAY90RFQtls8LUQUP\nW0z8jiaxDgxnbQavpgfVY1Q2o+OVAoBvVOd91OlxEIC3wGu++b+gm5k6Uk8OPkFL\n6i3zsActzrkd/ypyazZrvKMmiIjnnxE62oMLPR0FtqdKIWra3oj/W+NdiT765XJm\nLh+9sJzVYPkI58dWHF+HotxIYPHkMYb9ER1sk01QsbVQWMidjbhcPLjnoX7re5wY\nSDHihafEjKb5sDRrg9DUs2tdzWi5mA/XCY/7GpabnB77AgjxU4uOfqDxkUnqpXoO\nEGBwQZyQRigPUp0rsbLvQfZImEd5A8N3+PHSvsv/hj6HPOiNpur54+kiiJFoQcty\nW5r0L8jKgxffJUHuy+UCgJVtQqtdjLl7BU8vLkdEURenX8cycGYp2OQ4bX6ORpBe\nAPd7pobA2obnm/EL9xNfDW876PRP9oEoScAdROnVtSvhhe9sT6C7SkIe0yIjgXIX\nrqqsl+GfM6MZ7iEFlnEBF6/vUlch33r79dUiJRE/Xr47i1yr7y5pakDAbwEYeMIW\n5H2rwdE2ko49ruZnmASU\n=OoMd\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T03:50:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.co