.com/users/chinyicc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chinyicc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chinyicc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/696edf6a476aeea40d0bfdd213a7e52509d0a9a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:33:36Z","email":"chinyi615@gmail.com","name":"Chin-Yi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:33:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(VETS-CPC-2098): localization for employee portal nav bar (#1586)\n\n**JIRA:** [link to jira\nticket](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/69?selectedIssue=CPC-2098)\n## Context:\nLocalization for nav bar in employee portal, when user click on FR\nbutton, text translate to french, when user clock EN, text translate to\nenglish.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?: \nNo\n\n## Changes\nen.json\nheader.html\nheader.ts\nheader.css (button is highlighted when it is active)\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore:\n<img width=\"2816\" height=\"110\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9122819-006a-4c6d-9e7f-14f9ceefd0d6\"\n/>\n\nAfter\n- English:\n<img width=\"2324\" height=\"358\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef349d12-33a9-4537-ab95-477eb3216558\"\n/>\n\n- French:\n<img width=\"2302\" height=\"346\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b57a023-fea8-4e07-889c-0e60d6cf75c0\"\n/>\n\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links","tree":{"sha":"1984f3934b4b03d5e503887dee89d220a92d33bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git