linic/commits/abfecde0162a79db7991f1b2dda71707bb19482e"}],"sha":"696edf6a476aeea40d0bfdd213a7e52509d0a9a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/696edf6a476aeea40d0bfdd213a7e52509d0a9a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199511193?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JannoLawendy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JannoLawendy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JannoLawendy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JannoLawendy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JannoLawendy","id":199511193,"login":"JannoLawendy","node_id":"U_kgDOC-RMmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JannoLawendy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JannoLawendy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JannoLawendy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JannoLawendy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JannoLawendy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JannoLawendy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/abfecde0162a79db7991f1b2dda71707bb19482e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:30:08Z","email":"jannohany24@yahoo.com","name":"JannoLawendy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:30:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(BILL-CPC-1990): add specific exceptions (#1547)\n\n**JIRA:**\n[[CPC-1990](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1990)](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1990)\n\n## Context\n\nThe Billing Service previously used general exceptions when a customer\nor vet could not be found. This change adds specific exceptions so the\nerror clearly identifies which resource is missing.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?\n\nNo.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added CustomerNotFoundException for a missing customer.\n- Added VetNotFoundException for a missing vet.\n- Updated OwnerClient to use CustomerNotFoundException when the\nCustomers Service returns a 404.\n- Updated VetClient to use VetNotFoundException when the Vets Service\nreturns a 404.\n- Integrated the new exceptions into createBill() and\ngetBillsByCustomerId().\n- Updated the owner client, vet client, and billing service tests to\nverify the exception types and messages.\n- Removed obsolete commented-out code.\n- These changes only affect the Billing Service.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?\n\nNo.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?\n\nNo. The existing communication with the Customers Service and Vets\nService is unchanged.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n\nNot applicable. This PR does not change the UI.\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n\nBoth new exceptions extend `NotFoundException`, so they use the existing\n`BillControllerExceptionHandler`, which is configured to return HTTP 404\nresponses.\n\nThe full Billing Service test suite and the tests related to the new\nexceptions passed successfully.\n\nBuild result: `BUILD SUCCESSFUL`\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n\nNone.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ELS20680 <167457702+ELS20680@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f9411edae890093956e2ee809ea0805de88b4ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/2f9411edae890093956e2ee809ea0805de88b4ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/abfecde0162a79db7991f1b2dda71707bb19482e","verification":{"payload":"tree 2f9411edae890093956e2ee809ea0805de88b4ac\nparent c52f0c024c42dbe0b7d9646bbd80667fe5622a8c\nauthor JannoLawendy <jannohany24@yahoo.com> 1791423008 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791423008 -0400\n\nfeat(BILL-CPC-1990): add specific exceptions (#1547)\n\n**JIRA:**\n[[CPC-1990](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1990)](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1990)\n\n## Context\n\nThe Billing Service previously used general exceptions when a customer\nor vet could not be found. This change adds specific exceptions so the\nerror clearly identifies which resource is missing.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?\n\nNo.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added CustomerNotFoundException for a missing customer.\n- Added VetNotFoundException for a missing vet.\n- Updated OwnerClient to use CustomerNotFoundException when the\nCustomers Service returns a 404.\n- Updated VetClient to use VetNotFoundException when the Vets Service\nreturns a 404.\n- Integrated the new exceptions into createBill() and\ngetBillsByCustomerId().\n- Updated the owner client, vet client, and billing service tests to\nverify the exception types and messages.\n- Removed obsolete commented-out code.\n- These changes only affect the Billing Service.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?\n\nNo.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?\n\nNo. The existing communication with the Customers Service and Vets\nService is unchanged.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n\nNot applicable. This PR does not change the UI.\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n\nBoth new exceptions extend `NotFoundException`, so they use the existing\n`BillControllerExceptionHandler`, which is configured to return HTTP 404\nresponses.\n\nThe full Billing Service test suite and the tests related to the new\nexceptions passed successfully.\n\nBuild result: `BUILD SUCCESSFUL`\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n\nNone.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ELS20680 <167457702+ELS20680@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxvIgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWCEQAIfXZnxOBXL/G3iQw9khDbml\nRoJrrZN4uj4N8h9kpThBNv700h04Pw01C20aN8qOxoHid+RIz4ulMFM69Vp/c5Qq\nwiI