ills instead of\ndisplaying archived bills separately. This change gives employees a\ndedicated archived bills view while keeping archived bills hidden by\ndefault.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo.\n\n## Changes\n- Added a repository query to retrieve archived bills only.\n- Updated paginated retrieval and filtered counts to use the selected\narchive state.\n- Updated frontend filtering to separate regular and archived bills.\n- Changed toggle labels to “Show Archived Bills” and “Show Regular\nBills.”\n- Corrected the frontend request to use the V2 `/bills/paginated`\nendpoint.\n- Added tests for archived-only retrieval and counting.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nYes. The frontend uses `/api/v2/gateway/bills/paginated` because this\nendpoint accepts and forwards the `includeArchived` parameter.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nUI Before When Show Archived Bills Button is Activated:\n<img width=\"1846\" height=\"1001\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/623ab21b-eb67-41f6-a68d-937455dec744\"\n/>\n\nUI After When Show Archived Bills Button is Activated\nSelecting “Show Archived Bills” displays archived bills only. The button\nchanges to “Show Regular Bills.”:\n<img width=\"1847\" height=\"1002\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/85dbf2d6-b970-40b0-b879-923584d85642\"\n/>\n\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links","tree":{"sha":"3cbf4ca9938e3b76888393375176971ee32fe459","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/3cbf4ca9938e3b76888393375176971ee32fe459"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/c52f0c024c42dbe0b7d9646bbd80667fe5622a8c","verification":{"payload":"tree 3cbf4ca9938e3b76888393375176971ee32fe459\nparent 674f018dfd9129729163b55da4102d0abce1395b\nauthor Maxime Bergeron <pmmaster2020@gmail.com> 1791417509 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791417509 -0400\n\nfeat(BILL-CPC-2061): separate archived and regular bill views (#1585)\n\n**JIRA:** [link to jira\nticket](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-2061?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNTk4YTBjODUzNjA0NDU2NmE4YjMwM2Q0MmRhOTZlYTQiLCJwIjoiaiJ9)\n\n## Context:\nThe archived bills toggle previously included regular bills instead of\ndisplaying archived bills separately. This change gives employees a\ndedicated archived bills view while keeping archived bills hidden by\ndefault.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo.\n\n## Changes\n- Added a repository query to retrieve archived bills only.\n- Updated paginated retrieval and filtered counts to use the selected\narchive state.\n- Updated frontend filtering to separate regular and archived bills.\n- Changed toggle labels to “Show Archived Bills” and “Show Regular\nBills.”\n- Corrected the frontend request to use the V2 `/bills/paginated`\nendpoint.\n- Added tests for archived-only retrieval and counting.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nYes. The frontend uses `/api/v2/gateway/bills/paginated` because this\nendpoint accepts and forwards the `includeArchived` parameter.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nUI Before When Show Archived Bills Button is Activated:\n<img width=\"1846\" height=\"1001\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/623ab21b-eb67-41f6-a68d-937455dec744\"\n/>\n\nUI After When Show Archived Bills Button is Activated\nSelecting “Show Archived Bills” displays archived bills only. The button\nchanges to “Show Regular Bills.”:\n<img width=\"1847\" height=\"1002\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/85dbf2d6-b970-40b0-b879-923584d85642\"\n/>\n\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecifi