3\n## Context:\nAdmins shouldn''t be able to change delete a customers review on a vet.\nOnly the author of the rating should be able to do that.\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo\n\n## Changes\n\n- Removed the `|| isAdmin` condition from the delete rating button''s\nconditions.\n\n- Frontend only changes in the petclinic-frontend.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore:\n<img width=\"975\" height=\"483\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d55b3782-55b5-443a-b521-945f16e0d4d2\"\n/>\nAfter:\n<img width=\"975\" height=\"485\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f31b5b3-503f-486d-85c7-54b493e8828f\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n\n- Tested as admin and there is no delete rating button.\n- Tested as the rating''s author, the button works however there is no\nconfirmation message (could be added for as a new ticket).\n- Tested as another user who isn''t the author and we can''t see the\ndelete button.\n- Ownership is currently decided by comparing `customerName`, so two\nusers with the same name would both see the button. Differentiating\nbetween users with the same name could be a new ticket (e.g. by\nreturning a `customerId` in the rating response).\n\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nNone\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: caueal <167229700+cauealDEV@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"63291528635a36be18b20ea405f339238ae9ae96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/63291528635a36be18b20ea405f339238ae9ae96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/0df5729fe1912f8fd25b062d153f003cf0fcc90e","verification":{"payload":"tree 63291528635a36be18b20ea405f339238ae9ae96\nparent 6fddfbddaf964fbf5f75ec053ecc1393c68ea0ff\nauthor Saurya88 <tatinenisaurya@gmail.com> 1791380852 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791380852 -0400\n\nfeat(VETS-CPC-1903): Removed delete rating button for admin user (#1583)\n\n**JIRA:** https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1903\n## Context:\nAdmins shouldn''t be able to change delete a customers review on a vet.\nOnly the author of the rating should be able to do that.\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo\n\n## Changes\n\n- Removed the `|| isAdmin` condition from the delete rating button''s\nconditions.\n\n- Frontend only changes in the petclinic-frontend.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore:\n<img width=\"975\" height=\"483\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d55b3782-55b5-443a-b521-945f16e0d4d2\"\n/>\nAfter:\n<img width=\"975\" height=\"485\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f31b5b3-503f-486d-85c7-54b493e8828f\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n\n- Tested as admin and there is no delete rating button.\n- Tested as the rating''s author, the button works however there is no\nconfirmation message (could be added for as a new ticket).\n- Tested as another user who isn''t the author and we can''t see the\ndelete button.\n- Ownership is currently decided by comparing `customerName`, so two\nusers with the same name would both see the button. Differentiating\nbetween users with the same name could be a new ticket (e.g. by\nreturning a `customerId` in the rating response).\n\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nNone\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: caueal <167229700+cauealDEV@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxk10CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmy8QAEWRquYq8EO21cN4JWwEx4Hh\no/s4ulGe4G6XHYPsI//JLx/YYEeYpvzABCgaO1TithKW2y0nl6f9b+Z27K0dARYI\nGIg34cWQ5/M7YQzZWMSj8Qfq94KkisatXpjz8XlHIPCop5yLy9q6fn+vKbIrzE+V\nMbTu+diiuKrXiBFpkBB