:{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230245567?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MellonCat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MellonCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MellonCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MellonCat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MellonCat","id":230245567,"login":"MellonCat","node_id":"U_kgDODblEvw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MellonCat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MellonCat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MellonCat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MellonCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MellonCat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MellonCat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/675adbf67990c3bf35bf610019d7569a32e6492b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:53:10Z","email":"kyle.galbraith07@gmail.com","name":"Kyle Galbraith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:53:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(BILL-CPC-2065): Change the ubiquitous language from owner to customer (#1578)\n\n**JIRA:** [link to jira\nticket](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-2065)\n## Context:\nWhat is the ticket about and why are we doing this change.\nThis ticket changes the ubiquitous language from owner to customer\nthroughout the bill functionality. The goal is to make the terminology\nconsistent across the backend, frontend, endpoints and tests.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo\n\nIf the PR changes the .vscode folder, explain why in detail because it\nshould not.\nBe sure to include cgerard321 as a reviewer.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\nChanged the ubiquitous language from owner to customer across the\nbackend, frontend and tests.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo\nIf the PR uses the v2 API, explain why\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo\nIf the PR adds a new communication between services, make sure to update\nthe C4 L2.\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nIf this is a change to the UI, include before and after screenshots to\nshow the differences.\nIf this is a new UI feature, include screenshots to show reviewers what\nit looks like.\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Kyle Galbraith <kyleg@WHYWORLD>","tree":{"sha":"a3ad0ac2a53c8b955a67c5d574f72f0516b831b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/a3ad0ac2a53c8b955a67c5d574f72f0516b831b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/675adbf67990c3bf35bf610019d7569a32e6492b","verification":{"payload":"tree a3ad0ac2a53c8b955a67c5d574f72f0516b831b0\nparent 7a5044ee8f25889f14e8dff639a6c771f8812858\nauthor Kyle Galbraith <kyle.galbraith07@gmail.com> 1791337990 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791337990 -0400\n\nfeat(BILL-CPC-2065): Change the ubiquitous language from owner to customer (#1578)\n\n**JIRA:** [link to jira\nticket](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-2065)\n## Context:\nWhat is the ticket about and why are we doing this change.\nThis ticket changes the ubiquitous language from owner to customer\nthroughout the bill functionality. The goal is to make the terminology\nconsistent across the backend, frontend, endpoints and tests.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo\n\nIf the PR changes the .vscode folder, explain why in detail because it\nshould not.\nBe sure to include cgerard321 as a reviewer.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\nChanged the ubiquitous language from owner to customer across the\nbackend, frontend and tests.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo\nIf the PR uses the v2 API, explain why\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo\nIf the PR adds a new communication between services, make sure to update\nthe C4 L2.\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nIf this is a change to the UI, include before and after screenshots to\nshow the differences.\nIf this is a new UI feature, include screenshots to show reviewers what\nit looks like.\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Kyle Galbraith <kyleg@WHYWORLD>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxaYGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAEAQAFM9Mlq8p0eu9dXT1Lohc6k6\nk+UmzE0tFKQTLxGAGFQfW/4XUQXcBjHbuko+zTT4YLHKR3MAsfN1KmR8/M2u+W7a\nzE+bDrmqIRrHgu/TAWf8J/VA4mceQkKTIzSPgZkV4PUP7gyG00Zi/yfPuhsFpr0n\nwwDqg6N7DeTt6Rd9x3ncBojmLJSXX/akbxKcA9T6CqgKUkNqLB3BFLCRlVcwIXeb\nruH7BY1McF98UyGVV1kw05Dq86OIhb4TjsZs7ngHEgY4KRRLBQe1EhY6fxkdogNa\ng62K2OEB4bzjrrLRgv8gghAeRJ0ip87FAMK3K+zWvXnPb3RGAaqwHrGyhtnMUk+q\ngISwudRKP4/EYWgXLYO3W4xQ7x5PTmmQW2TFc5QyZ80q0c1x23DH7qyiRmyYR7sR\np6GlWdS2W1ZhDjluROQ8B6G9VXPBRTaNYXzldv/bTq0f/JQbxJeo+ij82I3qKi2h\nWo0aMUYHFyAC/RqxFZVGv46AhROkm3SSGdEAVfCoeyP4PZbNrX6hhyeIiMYrXZZ6\nCmenKC2ck22Gzf7a9mfRcqX6zy9OfXrILATqlCkEKxR+gUKJxLGyYLYedEaZ+spE\n77Fuv/nGWNVMKBrV/F6lBe5uJTkI2jm4cClatfF0BJQFRJXivHidh5V8N1iCfVBT\nNQwQV6GqJMTgAlCaItQu\n=8pGP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T01:53:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com