t.com/u/63722895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rami38/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rami38/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rami38/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rami38/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rami38","id":63722895,"login":"Rami38","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzIyODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rami38/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rami38/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rami38/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rami38/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rami38/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rami38","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/a67a08d1e4b5a76e867c516e236f4ff26fa74d41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:53:09Z","email":"63722895+Rami38@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Yacoub Bakayoko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:53:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"bug(CUST-CPC-2079): fix customer profile crashing on reload (#1579)\n\n**JIRA:** https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-2079\n\n## Context:\nReloading the customer profile page (/customer/profile) showed \"Error\nfetching customer data\" instead of the profile.\nOn reload, the user context starts empty while the session is checked\n(/users/jwt). ProtectedRoute rendered the page before that check\nfinished, so ProfilePage called GET /customers/ with an empty id and got\na 404. A 404 is not handled globally, so the page set its error state,\nand the error was never cleared when the real user loaded.\nThis is related to CPC-1951 (#1481), which made the redirects wait for\nisLoading, but the page itself was still rendered during loading.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo\n\n## Changes\n- ProtectedRouteProps.tsx: shows a loading message while the session is\nbeing checked, and only renders the page once a user is loaded and has\nthe required role (the existing redirects to Login / Forbidden are\nunchanged).\n- ProfilePage.tsx: skips the user/customer requests when there is no\nuserId, and clears the error after a successful load.\n- ProtectedRoute is shared, so every protected page now waits for the\nsession check before rendering.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n<img width=\"1855\" height=\"1085\"\nalt=\"cpc-2079-before-Customer-Profile-Crash-On-Reload\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a123ed9-4348-4a89-a9bc-a82753335c3e\"\n/>\n<img width=\"1805\" height=\"1062\"\nalt=\"cpc-2079-after-Customer-Profile-Crash-On-Reload\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f00e1fc5-6de4-4e66-8048-dd2ce95afe0f\"\n/>\n\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nTested:\n- F5 on /customer/profile as a customer: profile loads, no request with\nan empty id\n- Logged out + reload on /customer/profile: redirected to login\n- Admin on /customer/profile: redirected to Forbidden\n- Reload on other protected pages still works\n- npm run lint and npm run build pass\n\nRelated: CPC-2070 (profile photo doesn''t update on reload) touches the\nsame page.\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n#1481 (CPC-1951)\n\nCo-authored-by: Yacoub Bakayoko <2431671@champlaincollege.qc.ca>","tree":{"sha":"f99866234c27f40bc7248675c4a209c2bdf2fbb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/f99866234c27f40bc7248675c4a209c2bdf2fbb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/a67a08d1e4b5a76e867c516e236f4ff26fa74d41","verification":{"payload":"tree f99866234c27f40bc7248675c4a209c2bdf2fbb0\nparent 816f8574fcd0275bc8fab8d96e74b4933484ad7f\nauthor Yacoub Bakayoko <63722895+Rami38@users.noreply.github.com> 1791312789 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791312789 -0400\n\nbug(CUST-CPC-2079): fix customer profile crashing on reload (#1579)\n\n**JIRA:** https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-2079\n\n## Context:\nReloading the customer profile page (/customer/profile) showed \"Error\nfetching customer data\" instead of the profile.\nOn reload, the user context starts empty while the session is checked\n(/users/jwt). ProtectedRoute rendered the page before that check\nfinished, so ProfilePage called GET /customers/ with an empty id and got\na 404. A 404 is not handled globally, so the page set its error state,\nand the error was never cleared when the real user loaded.\nThis is related to CPC-1951 (#1481), which made the redirects wait for\nisLoading, but the page itself was still rendered during loading.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo\n\n## Changes\n- ProtectedRouteProps.tsx: shows a loading message while the session is\nbeing checked, and only renders the page once a user is loaded and has\nthe required role (the existing redirects to Login / Forbidden are\nunchanged).\n- ProfilePage.tsx: skips the user/customer requests when there is no\nuserId, and clears the error after a successful load.\n- ProtectedRoute is shared, so every protected page now waits for the\nsession check before rendering.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n<img width=\"1855\" height=\"1085\"\nalt=\"cpc-2079-before-Customer-Profile-Crash-On-Reload\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a123ed9-4348-4a89-a9bc-a82753335c3e\"\n/>\n<img width=\"1805\" height=\"1062\"\nalt=\"cpc-2079-after-Customer-Profile-Crash-On-Reload\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f00e1fc5-6de4-4e66-8048-dd2ce95afe0f\"\n/>\n\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nTested:\n- F5 on /customer/profile as a customer: profile loads, no request with\nan empty id\n- Logged out + reload on /customer/profile: redirected to login\n- Admin on /customer/profile: redirected to Forbidden\n- Reload on other protected pages still works\n- npm run lint and npm run build pass\n\nRelated: CPC-2070 (profile photo doesn''t update on reload) touches the\nsame page.\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n#1481 (CPC-1951)\n\nCo-authored-by: Yacoub Bakayoko <2431671@champlaincollege.qc.ca>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxUOVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwxEQAJNkQ2hwgkgSSS5rqic3CTMy\noEc3dICp3sPgfl5sqfhkZic6vFu7RPVJcEgbQlm6itBm1IJGyLy0ltgRTr02Rmr3\n5odkU9IvtZTwdjoHqyBJH4DcWCLoHOC7riuONVtJESvBsiaUHG+uZYrJ5wHBcEyo\ngtkaQ4LHkqq0w5HpCbrlrZi5WmjJljFxFSgEJUyodU+6NlWMFOFzztMnDC52fs/c\nOMw+HMycPJ07S5d/tbuUXfEUI7+P8wT7I1IPEeZrSO7o1L7rBH6mAbgeamnj/Gkh\n9cRMyYaWilZxf+DsfpVqNPA5Jm6tagzMMlSPUl9CUC2pxoko+M9bHTp0ZRwv2CdE\nkypFbHVB76la3pD1s1euE+C9Fsyuoktga1v9HakAfo95sxV+PqWXzx5+HPo4AaRg\nEpOs8CsGf0Nyy1wcaKGkYnbpT4pdkNuOS+rhpQZ8ViaWLMtKOLqczHNXLXp6TpxH\nMAfUMsTQC3jHwlrAGcjacenuNHurkOmm5zQ6GSF0hVL95mTOnhYRKBQSayHj13nH\n1ohGKqPzIOuDitDixW9oJwlTudIQ3pHX0UdT7Rdh2/P3tXWpRZkF3PKRvNlmDJ0z\nFXrhuesvA/YySKfvmeENhCG7qUn8wMcLf8iSuIKBj9R37OqAjv8MUC3BlaljhTfT\nf6D7h+ep5hGJZ7BEjkDZ\n=KLRx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T18:53:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commit/a67a08d1e4b5a76e867c516e236f4ff26fa74d41","node_id":"C_kwDOF4d909oAKGE2N2EwOGQxZTRiNWE3NmU4NjdjNTE2ZTIzNmY0ZmYyNmZhNzRkNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commit/816f8574fcd0275bc8fab8d96e74b4933484ad7f","sha":"816f8574fcd0275bc8fab8d96e74b4933484ad7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/816f8574fcd0275bc8fab8d96e74b4933484ad7f"}],"sha":"a67a08d1e4b5a76e867c516e236f4ff26fa74d41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/a67a08d1e4b5a76e867c516e236f4ff26fa74d41"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167229877?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackyKBK/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackyKBK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackyKBK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackyKBK/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JackyKBK","id":167229877,"login":"JackyKBK","node_id":"U_kgDOCfe5tQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackyKBK/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackyKBK/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackyKBK/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackyKBK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackyKBK/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackyKBK","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/816f8574fcd0275bc8fab8d96e74b4933484ad7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T03:47:51Z","email":"167229877+JackyKBK@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JackyB"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T03:47:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat(VETS-CPC-1982): Add section shortcuts to home page (#1569)\n\n**JIRA:** \n\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/69?selectedIssue=CPC-1982\n\n## Context:\nThis change adds shortcuts for the employee homepage. It allows users to\ngo from the homepage to vets, customers, bills, visits, inventory and\nproducts.\nUnlike the nav bar, this will be implemented later to route to specific\nfunctions like quick-add product, search repeat customer.\nIt wraps well around mobile devices and other small screens.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\n-Edited the homepage to reduce similarity to the customer homepage\n-Added shortcuts as cards and buttons\n-Routed the buttons to the right page\n-Made the styling consistent\n-Removed excessive comments\nAll changes were contained in the home page feature in the employee\nfrontend\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore:\n<img width=\"1536\" height=\"729\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/759df9de-3e6e-405a-957a-ebed0e8700a4\"\n/>\nAfter: \n<img width=\"1862\" height=\"922\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e5544bac-92ed-4bd1-b1f6-e9372c20f901\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n## Linked p