te_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gvxng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gvxng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gvxng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/4e1c8059a512e0326db96f53bf992710c82ec186/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T02:40:46Z","email":"yanisachamou@gmail.com","name":"Yanis Achamou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T02:40:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(CART-CPC-2040): pre-fill customer information in checkout (#1577)\n\n**JIRA:**\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/73?selectedIssue=CPC-2040\n## Context:\nWhat is the ticket about and why are we doing this change.\n\nThe checkout form previously started empty. This change pre-fills the\nform with information from the logged-in customer’s profile, making\ncheckout faster while keeping every field editable.\n\nPayment information is never pre-filled.\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nIf the PR changes the .vscode folder, explain why in detail because it\nshould not.\n\nNo.\nBe sure to include cgerard321 as a reviewer.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\nWhat are the various changes and what other modules do those changes\naffect.\nThis can be bullet point or sentence format.\n\n- Reused the existing getCustomer API function.\n- Used the logged-in user ID and email from UserContext.\n- Pre-filled the customer’s full name, email, telephone, address, city,\nand province.\n- Added the telephone field to the checkout form.\n- Converted the customer’s province name into the province code required\nby checkout.\n- Kept all pre-filled fields editable.\n- Preserved information entered while the customer request is loading.\n- Kept missing customer information empty.\n- Left card number, expiry date, and CVV empty.\n- Kept the checkout form usable if customer information cannot be\nloaded.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nIf the PR uses the v2 API, explain why\nNo.\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nIf the PR adds a new communication between services, make sure to update\nthe C4 L2.\nNo.\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nIf this is a change to the UI, include before and after screenshots to\nshow the differences.\nIf this is a new UI feature, include screenshots to show reviewers what\nit looks like.\n\nBefore:\n<img width=\"500\" height=\"805\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/436ab929-9ac1-4715-9894-90cff966b640\"\n/>\n\nAfter: \n<img width=\"864\" height=\"785\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a2f579e9-a752-49f4-85e8-df97ac334d00\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links","tree":{"sha":"b34b990579fce4dcf04ac29c00e1ea4219b6db00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/b34b990579fce4dcf04ac29c00e1ea4219b6db00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/4e1c8059a512e0326db96f53bf992710c82ec186","verification":{"payload":"tree b34b990579fce4dcf04ac29c00e1ea4219b6db00\nparent fe4694029f6657ad690f71bce87e522a9a3439ed\nauthor Yanis Achamou <yanisachamou@gmail.com> 1791254446 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791254446 -0400\n\nfeat(CART-CPC-2040): pre-fill customer information in checkout (#1577)\n\n**JIRA:**\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/73?selectedIssue=CPC-2040\n## Context:\nWhat is the ticket about and why are we doing this change.\n\nThe checkout form previously started empty. This change pre-fills the\nform with information from the logged-in customer’s profile, making\ncheckout faster while keeping every field editable.\n\nPayment information is never pre-filled.\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nIf the PR changes the .vscode folder, explain why in detail because it\nshould not.\n\nNo.\nBe sure to include cgerard321 as a reviewer.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\nWhat are the various changes and what other modules do those changes\naffect.\nThis can be bullet point or sentence format.\n\n- Reused the existing getCustomer API function.\n- Used the logged-in user ID and email from UserContext.\n- Pre-filled the customer’s full name, email, telephone, address, city,\nand province.\n- Added the telephone field to the checkout form.\n- Converted the customer’s province name into the province code required\nby checkout.\n- Kept all pre-filled fields editable.\n- Preserved information entered while the customer request is loading.\n- Kept missing customer information empty.\n- Left card number, expiry date, and CVV empty.\n- Kept the checkout form usable if customer information cannot be\nloaded.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nIf the PR uses the v2 API, explain why\nNo.\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nIf the PR adds a new communication between services, make sure to update\nthe C4 L2.\nNo.\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nIf this is a change to the UI, include before and after screenshots to\nshow the differences.\nIf this is a new UI feature, include screenshots to show reviewers what\nit looks like.\n\nBefore:\n<img width=\"500\" height=\"805\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/436ab929-9ac1-4715-9894-90cff966b640\"\n/>\n\nAfter: \n<img width=\"864\" height=\"785\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/