tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/f21b4dc5c38b1fa008bde1c257147841ab706846/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T03:45:48Z","email":"2404796@gmail.com","name":"nathantoko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T03:45:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(INVT-CPC-1306): add photo for supply (#1567)\n\n**JIRA:**\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/issues?filter=-1&selectedIssue=CPC-1306\n## Context:\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nAdds the Angular UI for selecting and previewing supply photos, helping\ninventory managers visually identify supplies.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\nAdded a supply image editor component with a photo preview.\n\nAdded Add Image, Change Image, and Remove Image controls.\n\nSupports JPG and PNG files with a 2 MB frontend size limit.\n\nIntegrated the image editor into the supply form.\n\nExpanded the form to show supply fields and image controls side by side,\nstacking them on smaller screens.\n\nKept photos optional.\n\n## Changes\nThese changes affect the employee frontend supplies feature.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n<img width=\"1447\" height=\"747\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03039f8f-02c9-4cd9-817e-9919d15d48c3\"\n/>\n<img width=\"1917\" height=\"1045\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/482629a8-dc80-4b7a-9829-a91c6c8b739b\"\n/>\n<img width=\"1915\" height=\"1045\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e7719d9-0c02-4f30-b2c4-4fb2f0c0bc18\"\n/>","tree":{"sha":"987997a6f0de644b99a5a2c294bc9f3029b36a76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/987997a6f0de644b99a5a2c294bc9f3029b36a76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/f21b4dc5c38b1fa008bde1c257147841ab706846","verification":{"payload":"tree 987997a6f0de644b99a5a2c294bc9f3029b36a76\nparent 0b9280a67b8a73c34cc8dfae1e4136063420bc0b\nauthor nathantoko <2404796@gmail.com> 1790912748 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790912748 -0400\n\nfeat(INVT-CPC-1306): add photo for supply (#1567)\n\n**JIRA:**\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/issues?filter=-1&selectedIssue=CPC-1306\n## Context:\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nAdds the Angular UI for selecting and previewing supply photos, helping\ninventory managers visually identify supplies.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\nAdded a supply image editor component with a photo preview.\n\nAdded Add Image, Change Image, and Remove Image controls.\n\nSupports JPG and PNG files with a 2 MB frontend size limit.\n\nIntegrated the image editor into the supply form.\n\nExpanded the form to show supply fields and image controls side by side,\nstacking them on smaller screens.\n\nKept photos optional.\n\n## Changes\nThese changes affect the employee frontend supplies feature.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required fo