pi.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/0b9280a67b8a73c34cc8dfae1e4136063420bc0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T03:38:18Z","email":"103219890+williammarcotte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"williammarcotte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T03:38:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(VIST-CPC-1885): Added cancellation form for visits (#1572)\n\n**JIRA:** link to jira ticket\n## Context:\nCurrently, when calling Delete /visits/cancelled returns 204 No Content\neven when there are no cancelled visits to delete.\nThe endpoint should return 404 Not Found when no cancelled visits exist.\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo\n## Changes\nAdded a cancellation popup that appears when the user clicks Cancel.\nAdded four cancellation reasons: appointment no longer needed, Pet owner\nis no longer available, Pet owner needs to reschedule and Other.\nAdded validation so a reason must be selected before cancellation can\nproceed.\nAdded an extra text field when Other is selected, and made it required.\nAdded frontend models.\nUpdated Visit and VisitResponseModel so cancelled visits can contain\ncancellationReason and cancellationReasonDetails.\nReplaced previous confirmation with the new cancellation form.\nAdded a dedicated cancellation endpoint instead of the generic status\nendpoint.\nUpdated the API gateway to forward the cancellation request to the\nvisits service.\nUpdate service to validate cancellation reason\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore:\n<img width=\"1023\" height=\"426\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-01 192648\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/24c0baf6-e4c6-4e2a-a844-2b4a15dd6d48\"\n/>\nAfter:\n<img width=\"2036\" height=\"421\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c149a7a9-704b-44df-928a-a9130e2c0143\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nNo notes\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nNo requests\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"49013a911a352dfdf953afd7685cb6131eff5667","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/49013a911a352dfdf953afd7685cb6131eff5667"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/0b9280a67b8a73c34cc8dfae1e4136063420bc0b","verification":{"payload":"tree 49013a911a352dfdf953afd7685cb6131eff5667\nparent f793b51e8736b5fc75e8e053a50ee9e4d061daa2\nauthor williammarcotte <103219890+williammarcotte@users.noreply.github.com> 1790912298 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790912298 +0000\n\nfeat(VIST-CPC-1885): Added cancellation form for visits (#1572)\n\n**JIRA:** link to jira ticket\n## Context:\nCurrently, when calling Delete /visits/cancelled returns 204 No Content\neven when there are no cancelled visits to delete.\nThe endpoint should return 404 Not Found when no cancelled visits exist.\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo\n## Changes\nAdded a cancellation popup that appears when the user clicks Cancel.\nAdded four cancellation reasons: appointment no longer needed, Pet owner\nis no longer available, Pet owner needs to reschedule and Other.\nAdded validation so a reason must be selected before cancellation can\nproceed.\nAdded an extra text field when Other is selected, and made it required.\nAdded frontend models.\nUpdated Visit and VisitResponseModel so cancelled visits can contain\ncancellationReason and cancellationReasonDetails.\nReplaced previous confirmation with the new cancellation form.\nAdded a dedicated cancellation endpoint instead of the generic status\nendpoint.\nUpdated the API gateway to forward the cancellation request to the\nvisits service.\nUpdate service to validate cancellation reason\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo\n#