997): implement filtering on supply page (#1568)\n\n**JIRA:**\n[CPC-1997](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1997)\n\n## Context:\nEmployees who need to find specific supplies within a selected inventory\nmore quickly need to filter.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\n- Added supply name, description, and status filters to the Employee\nPortal supply page.\n- Results update immediately without a full-page refresh or another API\nrequest.\n- Added Clear filters and a message when no supplies match.\n- Styled the filters to match the Employee Portal inventory page.\n- Added filtering tests. All tests pass.\n\nOnly the supply page and its tests are changed.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo. The page continues to load supplies through the existing\n`/api/gateway/inventories/{inventoryId}/products` endpoint.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n**Before**\n<img width=\"1905\" height=\"980\" alt=\"AfterSupplyPageNew\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/754675f4-c2de-4f04-88af-739a221bb1d4\"\n/>\n\n\n**After**\n\n<img width=\"1906\" height=\"991\" alt=\"AfterFilteringSupplyPage\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7a1ff18-2e81-4e99-a3a2-13795a38ea67\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nFiltering applies to the supplies already loaded for the selected\ninventory. Admins, inventory managers, and vets can filter supplies they\nare authorized to view.\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nNone.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Vikit <Vikit@VIK_LAP>","tree":{"sha":"3641f8bed921a94935c1c59bd57d910dbaaf0951","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/3641f8bed921a94935c1c59bd57d910dbaaf0951"},"url":"http