ins, inventory managers, and vets can filter supplies they\nare authorized to view.\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nNone.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Vikit <Vikit@VIK_LAP>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvx21CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAa7gQAEJyojIMOXLAcRbHcRGvbwel\n+ycaSuBbWSC/XmllXFxqYJy9mFa8MwOAdS3MxE4KPpXnr9pvRb8EET3XN6HIDWnr\n42rlLkcQz/oHPHwARAZUreRoVekuf0MGJRfAfQ0LJRTt+ZkSp8moJQ2WunFEOI7C\nZSqX1REtcsrFoZvyoywGICaMy42dDFEDPdT0BmsvB6G1YZeLa8wavwFntQT1qxg3\nia4VzPJHfukLDFZxylDK3X+qtPuIi52wk3zDCCGORXezqDWkhUCJpcC4EJd3IdFy\nHo2AHSFgkS+WmdxtBE0GLkUfsmPvfPAochHH6yzmET4sdsBBTSSCsExUfwhlGjZN\npZ66sPOCMF84vGR1amJkWg0P07pNvU71wUwcIYrYfK+MXN0ZoiLxpyk0ulK6Lz4C\nnFIpYc0LCPXnzPGX/zSXsQYfpGWuwUjAwN9v8VsdcbAuKOPyrw7zcE2+QWeHizHr\nqsIIkoQalPi0Hc+U0D5OivurNwbXyNKAzIG/7pIyFUKLG1avWbpeinq98ACVcqLp\n7RFyqNKhhVS+dPFzHz1+q2nwj3UpmJdWeIX/nK8GVvW6g3E5oA3Yn6bUR+pjA3tT\nwae7VXsJm1rtqrAQ8Xc7bp19TUdSfwGse1dLzQ8ewi04i66NZhIOH9agti/vqCbn\nqx79D98OJpX7LV+t+NB/\n=ekU6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T02:57:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web