"https://api.github.com/users/Jeffsonrey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeffsonrey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/84e99a332d643d700bd335402fc688098e167e23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T02:15:39Z","email":"etienne.khalil09@gmail.com","name":"Etienne Khalil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T02:15:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(CUST-CPC-2004) Add confirmation and error messages for pet profile (#1570)\n\n**JIRA:** link to jira ticket\n\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/14?selectedIssue=CPC-2004\n## Context:\nThe pet profile has no limitations to the inputs you can put in it in\neither the create or update forms.\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo\n\n## Changes\nAdded a check to refuse whether:\n- The name is longer than 20 characters\n- The weight is over 100kg\n- The age is over 50 years old\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo the changes are all done in the front end with existing\ncommunications\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore\n<img width=\"1284\" height=\"1222\" alt=\"PetCreatedWithCrazyStats1\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd76ac11-2bd4-4983-910a-5dd401d51de3\"\n/>\n<img width=\"1640\" height=\"1194\" alt=\"PetUpdatedSuccessfully\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46a39301-d3ca-4b13-808b-2cbb96ea4f2a\"\n/>\n\nAfter\n<img width=\"1375\" height=\"1225\" alt=\"unavailableCreate\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7be04ed9-f935-4875-bb9e-43413a5b3eec\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ORl0NN <olivierkhalil17@gmail.com>","tree"