url":"https://github.com/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commit/5f1600a2e44818352bb1b84430b181a841f06a87","node_id":"C_kwDOF4d909oAKDVmMTYwMGEyZTQ0ODE4MzUyYmIxYjg0NDMwYjE4MWE4NDFmMDZhODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commit/ff252b7ebda8fe0954bd4e6c4e6875247d51d1d0","sha":"ff252b7ebda8fe0954bd4e6c4e6875247d51d1d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/ff252b7ebda8fe0954bd4e6c4e6875247d51d1d0"}],"sha":"5f1600a2e44818352bb1b84430b181a841f06a87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/5f1600a2e44818352bb1b84430b181a841f06a87"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167229700?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauealDEV/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauealDEV/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauealDEV/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauealDEV/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cauealDEV","id":167229700,"login":"cauealDEV","node_id":"U_kgDOCfe5BA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauealDEV/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauealDEV/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauealDEV/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauealDEV/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauealDEV/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cauealDEV","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/ff252b7ebda8fe0954bd4e6c4e6875247d51d1d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:56:24Z","email":"167229700+caczzx@users.noreply.github.com","name":"caczzx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:56:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(VETS-CPC-1976): implement employee portal welcome page (#1546)\n\n**JIRA:** [VETS-CPC-1976](https://jira.example.com/browse/VETS-CPC-1976)\n\n## Context:\nThis PR implements the new responsive Welcome Page for the Employee\nPortal to PetClinic. It refactors the home component state handling,\nupdates layout styling, and establishes a Playwright E2E testing suite\nto ensure visual and functional stability across viewports.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo, no changes were made to the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend.\n\n## Changes\nFrontend (employee-frontend):\n* Refactored home.ts authentication state using reactive toSignal\nstreams.\n* Updated home.html and home.css with responsive layout styling, welcome\nheader, short introduction, and brand emblem.\n  \nTesting (employee-frontend/tests):\n  * Added playwright.config.ts with automated local webServer execution.\n* Implemented tests/homepage/home.spec.ts covering authentication\nnavigation, brand logo visibility, and mobile viewport responsiveness.\n* Updated .gitignore to exclude Playwright build artifacts\n(/playwright-report, /test-results).\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n\n|*Before*\n<img width=\"976\" height=\"485\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a7d99fc-4cc7-4b55-9946-713da1e10b2c\"\n/>\n\n*After (Desktop)* *(Paste screenshot of new welcome page on desktop\nhere)* |\n<img width=\"1855\" height=\"965\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15471874-9040-4f40-9913-5e4bf8925c45\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n* Ran Playwright test suite locally in headless mode (2/2 Chromium tests\npassed).\n* Targeted exact brand elements (`getByText(''PetClinic'', { exact: true\n})`) to prevent Playwright strict mode locator conflicts.\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n\nHow to Test & Use \n1.Navigate to the frontend directory: cd\npetclinic-frontend/employee-frontend\n2. Install dependencies: npm install\n3. Start the application: npm start\n\nRunning E2E Tests (Playwright)\n1. Install Playwright browsers: npx playwright install\n2. Execute the Playwright test suite: execute first npm start and in a\nnew terminal do npx playwright test\n3. To view test execution in interactive UI mode (this is the best): npx\nplaywright test --ui\nIt should look like this: \n<img width=\"1575\" height=\"980\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/682fee91-5802-4b96-aaf5-5efd410493c5\"\n/>\n\n4. To view test reports after execution: npx playwright show-report","tree":{"sha":"a245d718c16c6a42705771b0f7171c34280b4b9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/a245d718c16c6a42705771b0f7171c34280b4b9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/ff252b7ebda8fe0954bd4e6c4e6875247d51d1d0","verification":{"payload":"tree a245d718c16c6a42705771b0f7171c34280b4b9f\nparent 9881f841d09f2475b290c0ce101004d121245c86\nauthor caczzx <167229700+caczzx@users.noreply.github.com> 1790895384 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790895384 -0400\n\nfeat(VETS-CPC-1976): implement employee portal welcome page (#1546)\n\n**JIRA:** [VETS-CPC-1976](https://jira.example.com/browse/VETS-CPC-1976)\n\n## Context:\nThis PR implements the new responsive Welcome Page for the Employee\nPortal to PetClinic. It refactors the home component state handling,\nupdates layout styling, and establishes a Playwright E2E testing suite\nto ensure visual and functional stability across viewports.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo, no changes were made to the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend.\n\n## Changes\nFrontend (employee-frontend):\n* Refactored home.ts authentication state using reactive toSignal\nstreams.\n* Updated home.html and home.css with responsive layout styling, welcome\nheader, short introduction, and brand emblem.\n  \nTesting (employee-frontend/tests):\n  * Added playwright.config.ts with automated local webServer execution.\n* Implemented tests/homepage/home.spec.ts covering authentication\nnavigation, brand logo visibility, and mobile viewport responsiveness.\n* Updated .gitignore to exclude Playwright build artifacts\n(/playwright-report, /test-results).\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n\n|*Before*\n<img width=\"976\" height=\"485\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a7d99fc-4cc7-4b55-9946-713da1e10b2c\"\n/>\n\n*After (Desktop)* *(Paste screenshot of new welcome page on desktop\nhere)* |\n<img width=\"1855\" height=\"965\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15471874-9040-4f40-9913-5e4bf8925c45\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n* Ran Playwright test suite locally in headless mode (2/2 Chromium tests\npassed).\n* Targeted exact brand elements (`getByText(''PetClinic'', { exact: true\n})`) to prevent Playwright strict mode locator conflicts.\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n\nHow to Test & Use \n1.Navigate to the frontend directory: cd\npetclinic-frontend/employee-frontend\n2. Install dependencies: npm install\n3. Start the application: npm start\n\nRunning E2E Tests (Playwright)\n1. Install Playwright browsers: npx playwright install\n2. Execute the Playwright test suite: execute first npm start and in a\nnew terminal do npx playwright test\n3. To view test execution in interactive UI mode (this is the best): npx\nplaywright test --ui\nIt should look like this: \n<img width=\"1575\" height=\"980\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/682fee91-5802-4b96-aaf5-5efd410493c5\"\n/>\n\n4. To view test reports after execution: npx playwright show-report","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQB