ithub.com/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commit/9881f841d09f2475b290c0ce101004d121245c86","sha":"9881f841d09f2475b290c0ce101004d121245c86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/9881f841d09f2475b290c0ce101004d121245c86"}],"sha":"ff252b7ebda8fe0954bd4e6c4e6875247d51d1d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/ff252b7ebda8fe0954bd4e6c4e6875247d51d1d0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/210403601?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesse023-1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesse023-1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesse023-1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesse023-1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jesse023-1","id":210403601,"login":"Jesse023-1","node_id":"U_kgDODIqBEQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesse023-1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesse023-1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesse023-1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesse023-1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesse023-1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesse023-1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/9881f841d09f2475b290c0ce101004d121245c86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:17:12Z","email":"JDizon@stu.champlaincollege.qc.ca","name":"Jesse John Dizon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:17:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(BILL-CPC-1915): add calculated tax to bill invoice (#1532)\n\n**JIRA:**\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/15/backlog?selectedIssue=CPC-1915&text=BILL\n## Context:\nThis change adds taxes and their calculation to the bill invoice as\npreviously, only interest after a due date was being added.\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo, it does not\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\napi-gateway:\n- Added new fields to `BillResponseDTO`: `BigDecimal gstAmount`,\n`BigDecimal qstAmount`, `BigDecimal totalAmount`\n\nbilling-service:\n- Added `TaxCalculationUtil` in `util`\n- Added new fields to `Bill` and `BillResponseDTO`: `BigDecimal\ngstAmount`, `BigDecimal qstAmount`, `BigDecimal totalAmount`\n- Added `addTaxesToBill` signature to `BillService` and defined it in\n`BillServiceImpl`\n- Used `addTaxesToBill` in `createBill` and `updateBill`\n- Added new fields to the Bill builder helper methods in the tests\n- Added new cells for the new fields in the pdfGenerator\n\npetclinic-frontend:\n- Added the fields as `number` types to `Bill.ts`\n- Edited `AdminBillsTable.tsx` to include: `GST`, `QST`, `Total Tax` and\nreplaced `Taxed Amount` with `Total with Interest`\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo, it does not\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo, it does not\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nWhen viewing the Bill Details (BEFORE):\n<img width=\"637\" height=\"733\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-29 163740\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ed83800-8405-4952-b476-80e1ed9eadc7\"\n/>\n\nWhen viewing the Bill Details (AFTER):\n<img width=\"636\" height=\"835\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-30 011547\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e76e6e9-fc38-4b14-a692-b7f1a9fe5e3e\"\n/>\n\n\n\nIf this is a new UI feature, include screenshots to show reviewers what\nit looks like.\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n- Added an if/else block to calculate taxes in the mapper as there were\nprior bills that did not have taxes and would return a null value in the\nfrontend.\n- The taxes gets added to the amount, and the interest is calculated\nbased on the initial amount and added to the amount with taxes.\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ELS20680 <167457702+ELS20680@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"49ef240b83aeb7bad9ec1c0cb21fe4e282f78d54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/49ef240b83aeb7bad9ec1c0cb21fe4e282f78d54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/9881f841d09f2475b290c0ce101004d121245c86","verification":{"payload":"tree 49ef240b83aeb7bad9ec1c0cb21fe4e282f78d54\nparent a8b9f02dee393fb7798680df384f4e01bed96c3b\nauthor Jesse John Dizon <JDizon@stu.champlaincollege.qc.ca> 1790893032 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790893032 -0400\n\nfeat(BILL-CPC-1915): add calculated tax to bill invoice (#1532)\n\n**JIRA:**\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/15/backlog?selectedIssue=CPC-1915&text=BILL\n## Context:\nThis change adds taxes and their calculation to the bill invoice as\npreviously, only interest after a due date was being added.\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo, it does not\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\napi-gateway:\n- Added new fields to `BillResponseDTO`: `BigDecimal gstAmount`,\n`BigDecimal qstAmount`, `BigDecimal totalAmount`\n\nbilling-service:\n- Added `TaxCalculationUtil` in `util`\n- Added new fields to `Bill` and `BillResponseDTO`: `BigDecimal\ngstAmount`, `BigDecimal qstAmount`, `BigDecimal totalAmount`\n- Added `addTaxesToBill` signature to `BillService` and defined it in\n`BillServiceImpl`\n- Used `addTaxesToBill` in `createBill` and `updateBill`\n- Added new fields to the Bill builder helper methods in the tests\n- Added new cells for the new fields in the pdfGenerator\n\npetclinic-frontend:\n- Added the fields as `number` types to `Bill.ts`\n- Edited `AdminBillsTable.tsx` to include: `GST`, `QST`, `Total Tax` and\nreplaced `Taxed Amount` with `Total with Interest`\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo, it does not\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo, it does not\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nWhen viewing the Bill Details (BEFORE):\n<img width=\"637\" height=\"733\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-29 163740\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ed83800-8405-4952-b476-80e1ed9eadc7\"\n/>\n\nWhen viewing the Bill Details (AFTER):\n<img width=\"636\" height=\"835\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-30 011547\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e76e6e9-fc38-4b14-a692-b7f1a9fe5e3e\"\n/>\n\n\n\nIf this is a new UI feature, include screenshots to show reviewers what\nit looks like.\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n- Added an if/else block to calculate taxes in the mapper as there were\nprior bills that did not have taxes and would return a null value in the\nfrontend.\n- The taxes gets added to the amount, and the interest is calculated\nbased on the initial amount and added to the amount with taxes.\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ELS20680 <167457702+ELS20680@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvtvoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcwYQAFdDG4NTciLHyQvORW0IX6ro\nt15PUsdo9yz6wr7rtuQ3HU0t/JmWsBPwJeLvZl+9UC6WL+elUhwJfXNMgDzV+yxT\nsRR1VjX913TeLsUb9tCV7Gt6ARlfRpwXI326YJAvtnOM3V1kVTwdLi7CyyvkVTYF\nfZ3VFag5CmJ7/YI7vN+2MZcAw9GAe5o82rBW0RTTZfAsTZr+mmTXfyBSmxEKW09J\nbdDujPZH2nEcDrrg+M2nMRk2ewSxyXW3GzoRE6MJgjhX3UXbQXkakB5nIWnjpnjW\nkm4na8kKfyMb0TommewOBwG+ba/3ylgWyrCFZJ25iklvWqcQfGvqw+CFLwWKeaC9\nTSfYc/VXjeTaYEsyBSAeSQT/+lS0Nx/GmoQnI4YoV/QEzkgISfozIa4Ql4LzxiuN\nh6t1W54nL6l64/fHgdB5ShO4+jpPghHA633L7Izw+fJJ7edJnCwDjD9jSH8Jm8dn\nXmsafnBpPT3D9TTuOESXxlBgg2J0/0VOHAUxLNOQDcqy4OeLMpV7blwj85NXUwEa\nnnDMefgeNk/FDTv3uIIzcMbIpgH1CH5ZTAhw3QVD8uiReqeWt1xY0wUUk9vaMFR6\nMxcMKXX62znA0aEHgbhF2TimlJpf2hhC4HOsQmN44LH9vlgpBVCjy6vZxHBmwa3O\nJq8pTO6ILJib21nxpgZg\n=Bf1Z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T22:17:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commit/9881f841d09f2475b290c0ce101004d121245c86","node_id":"C_kwDOF4d909oAKDk4ODFmODQxZDA5ZjI0NzViMjkwYzBjZTEwMTAwNGQxMjEyNDVjODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commit/a8b9f02dee393fb7798680df384f4e01bed96c3b","sha":"a8b9f02dee393fb7798680df384f4e01bed96c3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/a8b9f02dee393fb7798680df384f4e01bed96c3b"}],"sha":"9881f841d09f2475b290c0ce101004d121245c86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/9881f841d09f2475b290c0ce101004d121245c86"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167229698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AarushP06","id":167229698,"login":"AarushP06","node_id":"U_kgDOCfe5Ag","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AarushP06","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/a8b9f02dee393fb7798680df384f4e01bed96c3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:34:21Z","email":"167229698+AarushP06@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AarushP06"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:34:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(PROD-CPC-1844): Search Product by Name in the Angular Backend (#1545)\n\n**JIRA:**\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/PROD-CPC-1844\n\n  ## Context:\nThis ticket adds product-name search to the new Angular employee\nfrontend. Admin users can search for products by entering a full or\npartial product name. The search is case-insensitive and helps\n  users find products more efficiently.\n\n  ## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo. This PR does not change the `.vscode` folder in\n`petclinic-frontend`.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n  ## Changes\n\n- Added a debounced product-name search field to the Angular\n`employee-frontend`.\n- Added support for partial and case-insensitive product-name searches.\n  - Added the `productName` query parameter to the existing Product API.\n- Updated `ProductControllerV1` and `ProductsServiceClient` in\n`api-gateway`.\n  - Added repository-level product-name filtering in `products-service`.\n- Added unit tests for the Angular service, Product page, gateway\ncontroller, Product controller, and Product service.\n- No changes were made to `petclinic-frontend` or the legacy AngularJS\nfrontend.\n\n  ## Does this use the v2 API?:\n\n  No. This PR uses the existing v1 Product API:\n\n  `GET /api/gateway/products?productName={searchTerm}`\n\n  ## Does this add a new communication between services?:\n\nNo. This PR uses the existing communication between `api-gateway` and\n`products-service`. No new service-to-service communication was added,\nso the C4 L2 does not need to be updated.\n\n  ## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n\n  Before:\n  - The Product List had no product-name search field.\n  \n<img width=\"1678\" height=\"878\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/35dd18b6-ccaf-4524-b129-bcd5057bc80c\"\n/>\n\n\n  After:\n- The Product List includes a search field labeled “Search products by\nname”.\n  - Search results update after a short debounce period.\n  - Partial and case-insensitive searches are supported.\n\n \n<img width=\"1679\" height=\"917\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1403eff7-46f4-48b4-866a-bfb046a762a2\"\n/>\n\n\n  ## Dev notes\n\n  - Product searches use `findByProductNameContainingIgnoreCase`.\n  - Empty search input reloads all products.\n- Angular search requests use `debounceTime`, `distinctUntilChanged`,\nand `switchMap`.\n  - Angular build passed.\n  - Focused ProductService backend tests passed.\n  - Full backend verification requires Docker/Testcontainers.\n- An unrelated existing Angular test compilation issue remains in\n`inventories/routes.spec.ts`.\n\n  ## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n\n  None.","tree":{"sha":"f8002ff8ec765d3b231042bff871ad0233fc5c01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/f8002ff8ec765d3b231042bff871ad0233fc5c01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/a8b9f02dee393fb7798680df384f4e01bed96c3b","verification":{"payload":"tree f8002ff8ec765d3b231042bff871ad0233fc5c01\nparent 390900a828153f832b8dcc570f42dfc06dc31c88\nauthor AarushP06 <167229698+AarushP06@users.noreply.github.com> 1790886861 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790886861 -0400\n\nfeat(PROD-CPC-1844): Search Product by Name in the Angular Backend (#1545)\n\n**JIRA:**\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/PROD-CPC-1844\n\n  ## Context:\nThis ticket adds product-name search to the new Angular employee\nfrontend. Admin users can search for products by entering a full or\npartial product name. The search is case-insensitive and helps\n  users find products more efficiently.\n\n  ## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo. This PR does not change the `.vscode` folder in\n`petclinic-frontend`.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n  ## Changes\n\n- Added a debounced product-name search field to the Angular\n`employee-frontend`.\n- Added support for partial and case-insensitive product-name searches.\n  - Added the `productName` query parameter to the existing Product API.\n- Updated `ProductControllerV1` and `ProductsServiceClient` in\n`api-gateway`.\n  - Added repository-level product-name filtering in `products-service`.\n- Added unit tests for the Angular service, Product page, gateway\ncontroller, Product controller, and Product service.\n- No changes were made to `petclinic-frontend` or the legacy AngularJS\nfrontend.\n\n  ## Does this use the v2 API?:\n\n  No. This PR uses the existing v1 Product API:\n\n  `GET /api/gateway/products?productName={searchTerm}`\n\n  ## Does this add a new communication between services?:\n\nNo. This PR uses the existing communication between `api-gateway` and\n`products-service`. No new service-to-service communication was added,\nso the C4 L2 does not need to be updated.\n\n  ## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n\n  Before:\n  - The Product List had no product-name search field.\n  \n<img width=\"1678\" height=\"878\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/35dd18b6-ccaf-4524-b129-bcd5057bc80c\"\n/>\n\n\n  After:\n- The Product List includes a search field labeled “Search products by\nname”.\n  - Search results update after a short debounce period.\n  - Partial and case-insensitive searches are supported.\n\n \n<img width=\"1679\" height=\"917\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1403eff7-46f4-48b4-866a-bfb046a762a2\"\n/>\n\n\n  ## Dev notes\n\n  - Product searches use `findByProductNameContainingIgnoreCase`.\n  - Empty search input reloads all products.\n- Angular search requests use `debounceTime`, `distinctUntilChanged`,\nand `switchMap`.\n  - Angular build passed.\n  - Focused ProductService backend tests passed.\n  - Full backend verification requires Docker/Testcontainers.\n- An unrelated existing Angular test compilation issue remains in\n`inventories/routes.spec.ts`.\n\n  ## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n\n  None.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvsPNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARoIQAKo57ZYzZDHjiNI+D2iPjZ1W\nzIz/3lPS/bTVR+m/g4ovWxN25nyrqPEPxAC2jMaAfHSZpfW5AradGePN8zxVTDtx\nR2TCS71f22Kya9FgRG5xqhpFZgrsBv4aY+/xP6Hbw9I4s/w0lsDQZHYeOAXsGmz0\nR1mCaFA4PuCDwcB0ubm+We41XLLOzVL1CJpsPWlEypdMZnVFBuajRyOzU495ztIt\nbZtbs+IUCjd/39V95apsaxI0KfXvq0h/Hw1biM79/2L0AoSECYm9v3AJk2bJtj2F\n/Etrarik611J5WCr7rkY6xLxxYTsGrrBrMliFtEdCgPCHAf57KX9SlReK5uXqBkP\nEgjvqcqv2MQefyeGbOQOmKxRUKLf9ByuJWBZWkCNFbxrZgxl0SQAIm2XmePLWpde\