:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204773783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gvxng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gvxng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gvxng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gvxng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Gvxng","id":204773783,"login":"Gvxng","node_id":"U_kgDODDSZlw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gvxng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gvxng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gvxng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gvxng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gvxng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gvxng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/390900a828153f832b8dcc570f42dfc06dc31c88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:17:47Z","email":"yanisachamou@gmail.com","name":"Yanis Achamou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:17:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(CART-CPC-1942): enable admin add to cart (#1553)\n\n**JIRA:**\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/73?selectedIssue=CPC-1942\n## Context:\nWhat is the ticket about and why are we doing this change.\n\nThis ticket allows an admin to add products directly to a customer’s\ncart from the cart details window. This helps admins manage customer\ncarts without having to log in as the customer.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nIf the PR changes the .vscode folder, explain why in detail because it\nshould not.\nBe sure to include cgerard321 as a reviewer.\n\nNo.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\nWhat are the various changes and what other modules do those changes\naffect.\nThis can be bullet point or sentence format.\n\n- Allowed the ADMIN role to use the existing add-product-to-cart\nendpoint.\n- Added an API function in the React frontend to add a product to a\nselected cart.\n- Added an Add product form to the admin cart details window.\n- Added product selection, quantity input, loading states, validation,\nand success/error messages.\n- Added an integration test confirming that an admin can successfully\nadd a product.\n\nAffected modules:\n- api-gateway\n- petclinic-frontend\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nIf the PR uses the v2 API, explain why\n\nNo. This change uses the existing v1 cart API.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nIf the PR adds a new communication between services, make sure to update\nthe C4 L2.\n\nIt uses the existing communication between the frontend, API Gateway,\nCart service, and Product service. No C4 L2 update is required.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nIf this is a change to the UI, include before and after screenshots to\nshow the differences.\nIf this is a new UI feature, include screenshots to show reviewers what\nit looks like.\n\nBefore: Admins could view and update a customer’s existing cart\nproducts, but there was no option to add another product.\n<img width=\"1407\" height=\"517\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5d475a50-b787-4d38-b97d-84d4c8230f58\"\n/>\n\nAfter: Admins can open a customer’s cart, select an available product,\nchoose a quantity, and add it to the cart.\n<img width=\"220\" height=\"99\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e28162da-bdb8-4f54-99c5-995651bb97c0\"\n/>\n\n<img width=\"1416\" height=\"783\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/791652a9-4b8d-415f-8b02-ec7ce34f2ae0\"\n/>\n\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links","tree":{"sha":"21620ede68e5b4b919e96242f6104970d5a79d9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/21620ede68e5b4b919e96242f6104970d5a79d9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/390900a828153f832b8dcc570f42dfc06dc31c88","verification":{"payload":"tree 21620ede68e5b4b919e96242f6104970d5a79d9c\nparent f5baebfcdf2aaecb95ed081b42237f4b947504c6\nauthor Yanis Achamou <yanisachamou@gmail.com> 1790885867 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790885867 -0400\n\nfeat(CART-CPC-1942): enable admin add to cart (#1553)\n\n**JIRA:**\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/73?selectedIssue=CPC-1942\n## Context:\nWhat is the ticket about and why are we doing this change.\n\nThis ticket allows an admin to add products directly to a customer’s\ncart from the cart details window. This helps admins manage customer\ncarts without having to log in as the customer.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nIf the PR changes the .vscode folder, explain why in detail because it\nshould not.\nBe sure to include cgerard321 as a reviewer.\n\nNo.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\nWhat are the various changes and what other modules do those changes\naffect.\nThis can be bullet point or sentence format.\n\n- Allowed the ADMIN role to use the existing add-product-to-cart\nendpoint.\n- Added an API function in the React frontend to add a product to a\nselected cart.\n- Added an Add product form to the admin cart details window.\n- Added product selection, quantity input, loading states, validation,\nand success/error messages.\n- Added an integration test confirming that an admin can successfully\nadd a product.\n\nAffected modules:\n- api-gateway\n- petclinic-frontend\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nIf the PR uses the v2 API, explain why\n\nNo. This change uses the existing v1 cart API.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nIf the PR adds a new communication between services, make sure to update\nthe C4 L2.\n\nIt uses the existing communication between the frontend, API Gateway,\nCart service, and Product service. No C4 L2 update is required.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nIf this is a change to the UI, include before and after screenshots to\nshow the differences.\nIf this is a new UI feature, include screenshots to show reviewers what\nit looks like.\n\nBefore: Admins could view and update a customer’s existing cart\nproducts, but there was no option to add another product.\n<img width=\"1407\" height=\"517\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5d475a50-b787-4d38-b97d-84d4c8230f58\"\n/>\n\nAfter: Admins can open a customer’s cart, select an available product,\nchoose a quantity, and add it to the cart.\n<img width=\"220\" height=\"99\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e28162da-bdb8-4f54-99c5-995651bb97c0\"\n/>\n\n<img width=\"1416\" height=\"783\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/791652a9-4b8d-415f-8b02-ec7ce34f2ae0\"\n/>\n\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvr/rCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2PEQAJpkgVGODAzrhIQGWwXCn5wX\nEoIro9bV0/vdbuXwt09mJxlrjH0JhR7lActna3pcUgkhLTLWgVWWqeW1t8o0NUnH\njsWkFDxLlOKwH+mvqrZmZSjh8ufr+IC1ybIcoRVD+lrI0L11UtGjHR2uOmCDfJGo\n9Mv2f6F4f0WDQ4fKB9nxtXsefDekm60alWK80YtYeJ4YZH60zIEUNlobg+x9ymPl\nx06XnN6pXPqLp23buM3hZrtMu1YL2brDQNCN9IKTD3eln52VCcZdjZ9DZ2xAUEEJ\nDgVTq9QAKp+LYsNPyBoD/oPVg6P7AmmLHYg/+HGcwPCZvcsZvf9ZASsmKqRau3d5\nCfSxovMTrpzF1Jc+D0Q