_url":"https://github.com/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commit/4ef69fe7daaf7dc03b989fa1441509499c977376","sha":"4ef69fe7daaf7dc03b989fa1441509499c977376","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/4ef69fe7daaf7dc03b989fa1441509499c977376"}],"sha":"5be16e719b823648e7f7a9aa089be4a9d1988ad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/5be16e719b823648e7f7a9aa089be4a9d1988ad4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230228854?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tokonathan","id":230228854,"login":"tokonathan","node_id":"U_kgDODbkDdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokonathan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/4ef69fe7daaf7dc03b989fa1441509499c977376/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:03:43Z","email":"2404796@gmail.com","name":"nathantoko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:03:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(INVT-CPC-1873): add inventory favorite star (#1535)\n\n**JIRA:**\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/issues?filter=-1&selectedIssue=CPC-1873\n## Context:\n\nThis ticket lets inventory managers mark inventories as favorites and\nfilter the page to find them quickly. This PR adds the favorite star to\nthe Angular inventory cards using the existing backend functionality.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added a star button to mark or unmark an inventory as a favorite.\n- Connected the button to the existing important backend endpoint.\n- Added selected and unselected star styles.\n- Added handling for failed saves and repeated clicks while saving.\n- Kept the star separate from the card link so clicking it does not open\nthe supplies page.\\\n- Also added the filter for favorites-only display.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo, uses the existing inventory API.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore: \n<img width=\"2556\" height=\"1217\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c6746d7e-e9f6-4c0c-8a36-20d4a4f630b6\"\n/>\n\n\nAfter: \n\n<img width=\"2556\" height=\"1292\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/729b7656-66c8-407e-8db4-61fefcc96204\"\n/>\n<img width=\"2555\" height=\"1288\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54fb3846-48ce-488e-bfef-51be42bec45d\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links","tree":{"sha":"8ca61fe8df465199e83677add18998df48415ead","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/8ca61fe8df465199e83677add18998df48415ead"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/4ef69fe7daaf7dc03b989fa1441509499c977376","verification":{"payload":"tree 8ca61fe8df465199e83677add18998df48415ead\nparent 446539c75d59e730837b2b451f33e76ca249e554\nauthor nathantoko <2404796@gmail.com> 1790874223 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790874223 -0400\n\nfeat(INVT-CPC-1873): add inventory favorite star (#1535)\n\n**JIRA:**\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/issues?filter=-1&selectedIssue=CPC-1873\n## Context:\n\nThis ticket lets inventory managers mark inventories as favorites and\nfilter the page to find them quickly. This PR adds the favorite star to\nthe Angular inventory cards using the existing backend functionality.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added a star button to mark or unmark an inventory as a favorite.\n- Connected the button to the existing important backend endpoint.\n- Added selected and unselected star styles.\n- Added handling for failed saves and repeated clicks while saving.\n- Kept the star separate from the card link so clicking it does not open\nthe supplies page.\\\n- Also added the filter for favorites-only display.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo, uses the existing inventory API.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore: \n<img width=\"2556\" height=\"1217\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c6746d7e-e9f6-4c0c-8a36-20d4a4f630b6\"\n/>\n\n\nAfter: \n\n<img width=\"2556\" height=\"1292\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/729b7656-66c8-407e-8db4-61fefcc96204\"\n/>\n<img width=\"2555\" height=\"1288\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54fb3846-48ce-488e-bfef-51be42bec45d\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvpJvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAq3QQAKP8kAOR36TMUyUoz5yWIyXv\n+DgKgNwZZo7mYuBTpE0aKGfsDQuBPl3K+bf2gpNlsbWAjHGSyJ7yqrWaKX0E8kc+\no3pwYWgMXkAdkcJAa+m1y8rh369eta8oYEnqD0B/Cin6YxvJV5D1NhUm3816uEVd\n1JgGAaub3I+6OAnf6hcOmq1aJiFR58qbysw5z7TBk11P69MpcKRwKrglBE9dee4e\nowGuiyQ/8NBTVoDxqIxEdUXlU/b0Yq3bCOfsWO0v0CbbbKS0oW3AtVTx8HbdAPVo\