ange the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nno.\n## Changes\nThis ticket adds a table to the customer page of the employee front end,\ndisplaying the information of all the different customers, to add\nsomething to the page. The customer feature in employee-frontend is the\nonly place where changes were made other than tscibfig.json.\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nno\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo. This PR uses the existing /api/gateway/customers endpoint\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore:\n<img width=\"1924\" height=\"874\" alt=\"1961before\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c8a5834-674e-483b-b1c7-8a919cf06c46\"\n/>\nAfter:\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"955\" alt=\"1961after\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2677c449-2e67-4258-a018-06b9127c872f\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links\n\nCo-authored-by: ORl0NN <olivierkhalil17@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Thomas Angers <thomas.angers@icloud.com>","tree":{"sha":"41e07305915b06575df12302f9801b09c6f4ea38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/41e07305915b06575df12302f9801b09c6f4ea38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/446539c75d59e730837b2b451f33e76ca249e554","verification":{"payload":"tree 41e07305915b06575df12302f9801b09c6f4ea38\nparent 5021eb2e12778c4f70d41309f5f9bda6490abe7a\nauthor Etienne Khalil <etienne.khalil09@gmail.com> 1790872428 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790872428 -0400\n\nfeat(CUST-CPC-1961): Added the customer list table in employee frontend (#1554)\n\n**JIRA:** \n\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/14?selectedIssue=CPC-1961\n## Context:\nThe customer page in the employee portal has nothing except for a test\nsaying coming soon, so we wanted to add some information to display for\nthe time being.\n\nThis ticket adds a table to the customer page of the employee front end,\ndisplaying the information of all the different customers, to add\nsomething to the page.\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nno.\n## Changes\nThis ticket adds a table to the customer page of the employee front end,\ndisplaying the information of all the different customers, to add\nsomething to the page. The customer feature in employee-frontend is the\nonly place where changes were made other than tscibfig.json.\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nno\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo. This PR uses the existing /api/gateway/customers endpoint\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore:\n<img width=\"1924\" height=\"874\" alt=\"1961before\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c8a5834-674e-483b-b1c7-8a919cf06c46\"\n/>\nAfter:\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"955\" alt=\"1961after\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2677c449-2e67-4258-a018-06b9127c872f\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links\n\nCo-authored-by: ORl0NN <olivierkhalil17@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Thomas Angers <thomas.angers@icloud.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvotsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABosQAG6ZI1CKarsGf1QADmAkHPE0\ncIMGtsf7hULZD4TQhivQwUftldNH8Impp+iMgvcV5WpUEsl0f/gUrpcGn1y68aDU\nGsTbRDRx7hIzCZD952aUM6c2Kaz+VmPszaTDPqnpFAO27DMKvKIjERU73VKEpKZj\njZye+FoHWpWzYq1PhaCRiM10SL2GOAtN7UEhtYcSNVEbR3BQBtpRn38kCmSzkB9c\nmZNZwxRl+UT7ZKLI0kJ42GUbrrqkLualAjg5O6FWjj4KfmetbxHRNWywYNg7tYp8\nz4SuIBOo4XvId89Tel4Dhk9LwWacT4S13+qArrAsmB0rJdx6UoZH7JAxPhlZcayJ\n+X5bfZImZAQ1ftW5kNaRp5txdrf1ox/TnKREqMWLD7mtWO1/vhgc3YbHTstTNV/c\naQpS3DjXhAaJoJ3v/jg3zQN0On5PCv9tNsCzMIicNalJ8KZCaFdCf6hy3phFWZ2L\nPPq8aD4dX1Mu1O/yW/nOr56SJ5cYNlUwkycAs3Yp/25PBxKk55MWREwkLYINi2Vn\n8iXKdUFX6fvYd