https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArushiNaik","id":203453743,"login":"ArushiNaik","node_id":"U_kgDODCB1Lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/5021eb2e12778c4f70d41309f5f9bda6490abe7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:43:48Z","email":"arushi.a.naik@gmail.com","name":"Arushi Naik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:43:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(BILL-CPC-1877): Create a Reactive Unbounded Pagination Method (#1557)\n\n**JIRA:**\n[[CPC-1877](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/804/backlog?selectedIssue=CPC-1877&text=bill)](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/804/backlog?selectedIssue=CPC-1877&text=bill)\n\n## Context:\nThe billing API currently provides bounded pagination for filtered bill\nqueries. This ticket adds a reactive, unbounded streaming option so\nclients can retrieve all matching bills without the existing pagination\nlimit.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo. This PR does not make any changes to the `.vscode` folder in\n`petclinic-frontend`.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added reactive unbounded bill streaming with `Flux<BillResponseDTO>`.\n- Added `GET /bills/stream` and corresponding API Gateway V1/V2\nendpoints.\n- Preserved existing bill filters.\n- Added frontend streaming API client and hook.\n- Added **View All Bills** / **Back to Pages** functionality.\n- Added unit and integration tests for the streaming endpoints.\n- Affected modules: `billing-service`, `api-gateway`,\n`petclinic-frontend`.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\n\nThe backend provides the new streaming endpoint through the V2 API\nGateway. The React frontend currently uses the V1 gateway route.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\n\nYes. The API Gateway now communicates with the billing service through\nthe new `/bills/stream` endpoint.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n\n**Before:**\n- Admin Bills displayed bills through the existing bounded paginated\nendpoint.\n- Bills were displayed using Previous/Next pagination controls.\n<img width=\"1493\" height=\"970\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c0703ac-246f-428e-b99d-60c75fac8473\"\n/>\n\n**After:**\n- Added **View All Bills** to retrieve bills through the reactive\nstreaming endpoint.\n- Streaming mode displays all matching bills without pagination\ncontrols.\n- Added **Back to Pages** to return to the existing paginated view.\n- Existing bill filters are preserved when requesting streamed bills.\n\n<img width=\"1475\" height=\"958\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e78cc978-fab4-4a77-8c96-6278ddd9a9c5\"\n/>\n\n<img width=\"1475\" height=\"978\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f76b679b-c864-47dd-8dc8-7231db149284\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n\n- Added unbounded reactive streaming with `Flux<BillResponseDTO>`.\n- Reused existing bill filters.\n- Added frontend support for consuming and displaying streamed bills.\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n\nNone.","tree":{"sha":"8b5dd23286e02a4087ccf51bf5369797d1cb676f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/8b5dd23286e02a4087ccf51bf5369797d1cb676f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/5021eb2e12778c4f70d41309f5f9bda6490abe7a","verification":{"payload":"tree 8b5dd23286e02a4087ccf51bf5369797d1cb676f\nparent 2fd83ccb858ff3d1455ecb3b8314e5cf146ad279\nauthor Arushi Naik <arushi.a.naik@gmail.com> 1790869428 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790869428 -0400\n\nfeat(BILL-CPC-1877): Create a Reactive Unbounded Pagination Method (#1557)\n\n**JIRA:**\n[[CPC-1877](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/804/backlog?selectedIssue=CPC-1877&text=bill)](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/804/backlog?selectedIssue=CPC-1877&text=bill)\n\n## Context:\nThe billing API currently provides bounded pagination for filtered bill\nqueries. This ticket adds a reactive, unbounded streaming option so\nclients can retrieve all matching bills without the existing pagination\nlimit.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo. This PR does not make any changes to the `.vscode` folder in\n`petclinic-frontend`.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added reactive unbounded bill streaming with `Flux<BillResponseDTO>`.\n- Added `GET /bills/stream` and corresponding API Gateway V1/V2\nendpoints.\n- Preserved existing bill filters.\n- Added frontend streaming API client and hook.\n- Added **View All Bills** / **Back to Pages** functionality.\n- Added unit and integration tests for the streaming endpoints.\n- Affected modules: `billing-service`, `api-gateway`,\n`petclinic-frontend`.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\n\nThe backend provides the new streaming endpoint through the V2 API\nGateway. The React frontend currently uses the V1 gateway route.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\n\nYes. The API Gateway now communicates with the billing service through\nthe new `/bills/stream` endpoint.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n\n**Before:**\n- Admin Bills displayed bills through the existing bounded paginated\nendpoint.\n- Bills were displayed using Previous/Next pagination controls.\n<img width=\"1493\" height=\"970\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c0703ac-246f-428e-b99d-60c75fac8473\"\n/>\n\n**After:**\n- Added **View All Bills** to retrieve bills through the reactive\nstreaming endpoint.\n- Streaming mode displays all matching bills without pagination\ncontrols.\n- Added **Back to Pages** to return to the existing paginated view.\n- Existing bill filters are preserved when requesting streamed bills.\n\n<img width=\"1475\" height=\"958\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e78cc978-fab4-4a77-8c96-6278ddd9a9c5\"\n/>\n\n<img width=\"1475\" height=\"978\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f76b679b-c864-47dd-8dc8-7231db149284\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n\n- Added unbounded reactive streaming with `Flux<BillResponseDTO>`.\n- Reused existing bill filters.\n- Added frontend support for consuming and displaying streamed bills.\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n\nNone.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvn+0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlSgQAALKfOvvto9VPzk9M2DCKvdn\nE2llLuWsRdK8c4CZbELLQob7jqyJaMswZIubDE+kIVcQg9MZU9JevbmASFhIj1qb\n/bTMRdpsxysjKSbfbb6y7nbsWuV9CGp2C2YVPcXBStblLONCLP7l1VDz2+vFITf3\nKwvJnuum/RzWy/2+jEzMuxWcagf6N/bw39C4NHE37JGjr55JHHwWlQ5EQ2fcHtzx\nmYBWGUuM0A3thUmZxknDgIkPOCKOZZNt4z9FrQDiQMc2LW+JkmYN3gD3h8cBnvOk\n/Mr0psMaazAB/GZovY7hiok7kLwOmPyO8dxTXnKE/RzZ2+G8TzXnT4B9P7BUz8cT\nZsk3kvK