12778c4f70d41309f5f9bda6490abe7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208994838?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agnesa24/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agnesa24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agnesa24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agnesa24/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Agnesa24","id":208994838,"login":"Agnesa24","node_id":"U_kgDODHUCFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agnesa24/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agnesa24/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agnesa24/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agnesa24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agnesa24/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agnesa24","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/2fd83ccb858ff3d1455ecb3b8314e5cf146ad279/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:22:15Z","email":"agnesaverenceanu@gmail.com","name":"Agnesa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:22:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"bug(CART-CPC-1943):  remove items from the wishlist by unselecting the heart icon (#1544)\n\n**JIRA:** link to jira ticket\n\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1943\n\n## Context:\nWhat is the ticket about and why are we doing this change.\n\nBefore, the customer was able to add to the wishlist by clicking on the\nheart icon. However, it was not possible to remove it from the wishlist\nthat easily. To provide a better user experience, the heart icon should\nalso remove the product from wishlist when unselecting it.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nIf the PR changes the .vscode folder, explain why in detail because it\nshould not.\nBe sure to include cgerard321 as a reviewer.\nNo. \n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\nWhat are the various changes and what other modules do those changes\naffect.\n\n- added a removeProductFromWishlist.tsx file to implement the logic\nbehind the removal of the product\n- added a handleRemoveFromWishlist method in the Product.tsx to validate\nthat the user is loged in and send a \"successful\" message\n- added another method to handle the logic behind the onClick() method\n\nThis can be bullet point or sentence format.\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nIf the PR uses the v2 API, explain why\nNo. \n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nIf the PR adds a new communication between services, make sure to update\nthe C4 L2.\nNo. \n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nIf this is a change to the UI, include before and after screenshots to\nshow the differences.\nIf this is a new UI feature, include screenshots to show reviewers what\nit looks like.\nN/A\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links\nN/A","tree":{"sha":"b6680f87da94c66574fd839553cda72825034d45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/b6680f87da94c66574fd839553cda72825034d45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/2fd83ccb858ff3d1455ecb3b8314e5cf146ad279","verification":{"payload":"tree b6680f87da94c66574fd839553cda72825034d45\nparent 20d8b58dcd33b8d3f1f4bbcecc29779515ce9334\nauthor Agnesa <agnesaverenceanu@gmail.com> 1790868135 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790868135 -0400\n\nbug(CART-CPC-1943):  remove items from the wishlist by unselecting the heart icon (#1544)\n\n**JIRA:** link to jira ticket\n\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1943\n\n## Context:\nWhat is the ticket about and why are we doing this change.\n\nBefore, the customer was able to add to the wishlist by clicking on the\nheart icon. However, it was not possible to remove it from the wishlist\nthat easily. To provide a better user experience, the heart icon should\nalso remove the product from wishlist when unselecting it.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nIf the PR changes the .vscode folder, explain why in detail because it\nshould not.\nBe sure to include cgerard321 as a reviewer.\nNo. \n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\nWhat are the various changes and what other modules do those changes\naffect.\n\n- added a removeProductFromWishlist.tsx file to implement the logic\nbehind the removal of the product\n- added a handleRemoveFromWishlist method in the Product.tsx to validate\nthat the user is loged in and send a \"successful\" message\n- added another method to handle the logic behind the onClick() method\n\nThis can be bullet point or sentence format.\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nIf the PR uses the v2 API, explain why\nNo. \n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nIf the PR adds a new communication between services, make sure to update\nthe C4 L2.\nNo. \n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nIf this is a change to the UI, include before and after screenshots to\nshow the differences.\nIf this is a new UI feature, include screenshots to show reviewers what\nit looks like.\nN/A\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links\nN/A","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvnqnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAofwQAF1dIJveXZ6KPnweR5cTkmtb\nrx0veeZq4z8X46f07jXf1RXOL9ucLKgJxfDl+AHN7X37MjfzMLnDo8iTf