8d3f1f4bbcecc29779515ce9334","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/20d8b58dcd33b8d3f1f4bbcecc29779515ce9334"}],"sha":"2fd83ccb858ff3d1455ecb3b8314e5cf146ad279","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/2fd83ccb858ff3d1455ecb3b8314e5cf146ad279"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/210409230?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamB-Git7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamB-Git7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamB-Git7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamB-Git7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdamB-Git7","id":210409230,"login":"AdamB-Git7","node_id":"U_kgDODIqXDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamB-Git7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamB-Git7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamB-Git7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamB-Git7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamB-Git7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamB-Git7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/20d8b58dcd33b8d3f1f4bbcecc29779515ce9334/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:39:54Z","email":"benikhlef.adam@gmail.com","name":"AdamB-Git7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:39:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(CUST-CPC-1969): localize pet management forms and modals (#1548)\n\n**JIRA:** https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1969\n## Context:\nAs a customer, I want the pet creation and editing pages and modals to\nbe localized, so that all customer-facing text displays correctly in\nEnglish or French when I change the application language. This builds on\nthe i18n setup from CPC-1962 (#1484).\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo.\n\n## Changes\n- Added a `pets` section to `public/locales/en/customers.json` and\n`public/locales/fr/customers.json` (titles, labels, buttons, pet types,\nvalidation errors, success messages, loading/not-found screens, delete\nconfirmations). Both files have the same keys.\n- Replaced all hardcoded customer-facing text with `t()` from\n`react-i18next` in:\n  - `AddPetForm.tsx` and `UpdatePetForm.tsx` (full-page forms)\n  - `AddPetModal.tsx` and `EditPetModal.tsx` (modals)\n- Validation errors and success messages now store the translation key\nin state and are translated when rendered, so they update immediately\nwhen the language is switched.\n- Pet type names from the backend are translated with\n`pets.types.<name>`, falling back to the original name if no translation\nexists.\n- `customers.css`: added `height: auto` to the customer modal primary\nbutton. The global `button[type=''submit'']` rule in `Login.css` forces a\n45px height, which cut off longer French text (\"Mettre à jour\nl''animal\").\n- Only affects the customer pet screens (Profile page, Customer Details\npage, add/edit pet pages).\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo. No API calls were changed.\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo.\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n**Add Pet modal**\n- Before (FR selected, text still in English):\n<img width=\"762\" height=\"757\" alt=\"CrEn\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c9cce46-3791-4c1e-a301-93162d8459d4\"\n/>\n\n- After (FR):\n<img width=\"747\" height=\"747\" alt=\"CrFr\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1692def-2cbc-4ba8-968a-19e77e8b36b3\"\n/>\n\n**Edit Pet modal**\n- Before (FR selected, text still in English):\n<img width=\"757\" height=\"757\" alt=\"EdEn\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/71548095-a6cc-4d52-a3b8-ac922c803aa0\"\n/>\n\n- After (FR):\n<img width=\"747\" height=\"767\" alt=\"EdFr\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe548559-b6c6-4ad5-a453-4dbae41647b6\"\n/>\n\n**Validation errors**\n- After (FR):\n<img width=\"772\" height=\"768\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed87ca38-2288-4a34-9fe7-28bbb3ec0667\"\n/>\n\n**Add Pet page (form)**\n- After (FR):\n<img width=\"1870\" height=\"883\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/49886d58-4714-4122-b880-04f81ca86093\"\n/>\n\n**Update Pet page (form)**\n- After (FR):\n<img width=\"1872\" height=\"875\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b72e825-39fc-440b-b1a2-3de89952f5d6\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n- Some English wording was unified between the forms and the modals so\nthey share one key each (e.g. \"Pet name is required\", \"Confirm Delete\").\n- Known limitation: the photo-delete confirmation (`useConfirmModal` in\n`EditPetModal`) is translated when it opens, so it doesn''t switch\nlanguage while already open. A separate ticket will cover this.\n- Existing bug noticed, not changed here: `UpdatePetForm` is routed at\n`/pets/:petId/edit` (no `customerId`), but `handleSubmit` returns early\nwhen `customerId` is missing.\n- `AddPetForm` and `UpdatePetForm` were also localized, but they are no\nlonger linked anywhere in the UI (only reachable by URL:\n`/customers/:customerId/pets/new` and `/pets/:petId/edit`). The modals\nreplaced them.\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n- #1484 (CPC-1962, i18n setup)\n- #1538 (CPC-1968, also adds keys to `customers.json`)","tree":{"sha":"703ce0b6128035e1b16c2b64fdf05f763ef6bb00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/703ce0b6128035e1b16c2b64fdf05f763ef6bb00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/20d8b58dcd33b8d3f1f4bbcecc29779515ce9334","verification":{"payload":"tree 703ce0b6128035e1b16c2b64fdf05f763ef6bb00\nparent aaf0328d9adc489c27c29a13bae9ad8c61cf7430\nauthor AdamB-Git7 <benikhlef.adam@gmail.com> 1790861994 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790861994 -0400\n\nfeat(CUST-CPC-1969): localize pet management forms and modals (#1548)\n\n**JIRA:** https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1969\n## Context:\nAs a customer, I want the pet creation and editing pages and modals to\nbe localized, so that all customer-facing text displays correctly in\nEnglish or French when I change the application language. This builds on\nthe i18n setup from CPC-1962 (#1484).\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo.\n\n## Changes\n- Added a `pets` section to `public/locales/en/customers.json` and\n`public/locales/fr/customers.json` (titles, labels, buttons, pet types,\nvalidation errors, success messages, loading/not-found screens, delete\nconfirmations). Both files have the same keys.\n- Replaced all hardcoded customer-facing text with `t()` from\n`react-i18next` in:\n  - `AddPetForm.tsx` and `UpdatePetForm.tsx` (full-page forms)\n  - `AddPetModal.tsx` and `EditPetModal.tsx` (modals)\n- Validation errors and success messages now store the translation key\nin state and are translated when rendered, so they update immediately\nwhen the language is switched.\n- Pet type names from the backend are translated with\n`pets.types.<name>`, falling back to the original name if no translation\nexists.\n- `customers.css`: added `height: auto` to the customer modal primary\nbutton. The global `button[type=''submit'']` rule in `Login.css` forces a\n45px height, which cut off longer French text (\"Mettre à jour\nl''animal\").\n- Only affects the customer pet screens (Profile page, Customer Details\npage, add/edit pet pages).\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo. No API calls were changed.\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo.\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\n**Add Pet modal**\n- Before (FR selected, text still in English):\n<img width=\"762\" height=\"757\" alt=\"CrEn\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c9cce46-3791-4c1e-a301-93162d8459d4\"\n/>\n\n- After (FR):\n<img width=\"747\" height=\"747\" alt=\"CrFr\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1692def-2cbc-4ba8-968a-19e77e8b36b3\"\n/>\n\n**Edit Pet modal**\n- Before (FR selected, text still in English):\n<img width=\"757\" height=\"757\" alt=\"EdEn\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/71548095-a6cc-4d52-a3b8-ac922c803aa0\"\n/>\n\n- After (FR):\n<img width=\"747\" height=\"767\" alt=\"EdFr\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe548559-b6c6-4ad5-a453-4dbae41647b6\"\n/>\n\n**Validation errors**\n- After (FR):\n<img width=\"772\" height=\"768\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed87ca38-2288-4a34-9fe7-28bbb3ec0667\"\n/>\n\n**Add Pet page (form)**\n- After (FR):\n<img width=\"1870\" height=\"883\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/49886d58-4714-4122-b880-04f81ca86093\"\n/>\n\n**Update Pet page (form)**\n- After (FR):\n<img width=\"1872\" height=\"875\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b72e825-39fc-440b-b1a2-3de89952f5d6\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n- Some English wording was unified between the forms and the modals so\nthey share one key each (e.g. \"Pet name is required\", \"Confirm Delete\").\n- Known limitation: the photo-delete confirmation (`useConfirmModal` in\n`EditPetModal`) is translated when it opens, so it doesn''t switch\nlanguage while already open. A separate ticket will cover this.\n- Existing bug noticed, not changed here: `UpdatePetForm` is routed at\n`/pets/:petId/edit` (no `customerId`), but `handleSubmit` returns early\nwhen `customerId` is missing.\n- `AddPetForm` and `UpdatePetForm` were also localized, but they are no\nlonger linked anywhere in the UI (only reachable by URL:\n`/customers/:customerId/pets/new` and `/pets/:petId/edit`). The modals\nreplaced them.\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\n- #1484 (CPC-1962, i18n setup)\n- #1538 (CPC-1968, also adds keys to `customers.json`)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvmKqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA980QAJCGtHZyTKRN/Rp2vYMSkZDB\nnpTGKAmED/rXsyt+h+UtfRr2PXhEG8/T9Wp4VeEc3ZwlIJQznDxFHJFZ4PyP/ShT\nCi9HM4vL2yesUknjlFHBl0q3Aq0Gb108e4IZRT6St5CqMkEGOb5PdkiErKXTd/fU\nGcriz/kiLAS31bwoBBA7s0mtQYu8sHP6ks4Pv/xh8lLMfedG241ZBtQlxxb4l4+C\nZkD7el9Fskvw+sqMPmbJrF2EqUF+2EBMRg0m75WQ7ViziG9dwvrngGCafyMPpz1h\nTa7XUg8DYEg3A7J9Mm1abcHf7/xDF31h3ZqMkRHSkmx9+5EwpFaBM47PlMRnX5YB\n0Wuz2U03xqzhk/SGSCo331DR5qC1PEvx5JQwq6wKZfsf6VGBIuyt2nmr9U/Bct53\n/dAUrDKJ5opkoHGb0qXLxcXvTv74HDjEnVA30odZVVIpE7RY2sM6ZlOslustJfZs\nXlidKxIRk0/wgKg3C13ypIQ/nhD9S6P564waBga5Fm6AfyQwpLo4TTOyJEJ+7zX4\n5uXYONByDtt132Dn/Bh1jtILNCa7g+pLwtGhrSdmaHhsyfHC2EAPDBqLA414+D+C\nq1gXzMtt2jrB+D5jq/r3uAeeKhXQluGIlLZnsCWt0ua168LTZGcGU7tW16Wgb0VK\nxoppsXL7KCbK4Pu7sp7P\n=4X8H\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T13:39:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commit/20d8b58dcd33b8d3f1f4bbcecc29779515ce9334","node_id":"C_kwDOF4d909oAKDIwZDhiNThkY2QzM2I4ZDNmMWY0YmJjZWNjMjk3Nzk1MTVjZTkzMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commit/aaf0328d9adc489c27c29a13bae9ad8c61cf7430","sha":"aaf0328d9adc489c27c29a13bae9ad8c61cf7430","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/aaf0328d9adc489c27c29a13bae9ad8c61cf7430"}],"sha":"20d8b58dcd33b8d3f1f4bbcecc29779515ce9334","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/20d8b58dcd33b8d3f1f4bbcecc29779515ce9334"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184125158?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxime-Bergeron/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxime-Bergeron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxime-Bergeron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxime-Bergeron/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maxime-Bergeron","id":184125158,"login":"Maxime-Bergeron","node_id":"U_kgDOCvmG5g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxime-Bergeron/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxime-Bergeron/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxime-Bergeron/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxime-Bergeron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxime-Bergeron/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxime-Bergeron","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/aaf0328d9adc489c27c29a13bae9ad8c61cf7430/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T12:47:01Z","email":"pmmaster2020@gmail.com","name":"Maxime Bergeron"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T12:47:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"bug(BILL-CPC-1878): Fix current Archive and Pagination Function (#1521)\n\n**JIRA:** [link to jira\nticket](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1878?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiY2I0N2QyNWVlZWQ5NDg2NWEwODgwNzA1MjU1ZjNiOTYiLCJwIjoiaiJ9)\n## Context:\nThis ticket fixes the BILL archive and pagination behavior.\nPreviously, archived bills could be removed after pagination had already\nhappened, which could cause a page that should display 10 bills to show\nfewer than 10 visible bills.\nThe page count could also include archived bills even when archived\nbills were hidden.\nThis change makes the archive option part of the pagination request so\nthat visible bills are filtered before pagination and counted correctly.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo it does not\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\n\n- Updated BillServiceClient.java to forward the includeArchived\nparameter for pagination and bill count requests.\n- Updated BillController.java in the API Gateway V2 layer to accept\nincludeArchived and pass it to BillServiceClient.\n- Updated BillService.java to add overloads for pagination and count\nmethods that support includeArchived.\n- Updated BillServiceImpl.java to filter archived bills before\npagination and to count bills using the same archive setting.\n- Updated BillController.java in the billing service to accept\nincludeArchived, apply default page/size values, and forward the archive\nsetting to the service layer.\n- Updated getAllBillsPaginated.tsx to send includeArchived with\npaginated BILL requests.\n- Updated useGetAllBillsPaginated.ts to accept and forward the\nincludeArchived value.\n- Updated AdminBillsListTable.tsx to connect the Show Archived / Hide\nArchived option to backend pagination and reset to the first page when\narchive visibility changes.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nYes\nThe existing paginated BILL frontend request already used the V2 API\nthrough \"useV2: true\" before CPC-1878.\nThis ticket did not introduce the V2 endpoint. It only extends the\nexisting BILL pagination flow by passing the optional \"includeArchived\"\nquery parameter\nThe \"includeArchived\" parameter itself is backwards compatible.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore changes, no pagination without archived bills:\n<img width=\"1847\" height=\"1002\" alt=\"bug-cpc-1878-before-unpaginated\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/66ba8f98-caf0-4a0b-becd-916b009cbeac\"\n/>\n\nAfter changes, pagination with and without archived bills (max 10 bills\nper page):\n<img width=\"1845\" height=\"1002\" alt=\"bug-cpc-1878-after-zoomed_out\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/62f3d836-2893-4522-b7a6-3b173a8732a5\"\n/>\n\n\n## Dev notes\nWhile finishing my tests, I realized that the filtering function wasn''t\naffected when fixing pagination. Will need to create a new ticket for\nfixing filtering in general.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Arushi Naik <arushi.a.naik@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"45b08676e8fa38d3c7efecadac65de68386ecbed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/45b08676e8fa38d3c7efecadac65de68386ecbed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/aaf0328d9adc489c27c29a13bae9ad8c61cf7430","verification":{"payload":"tree 45b08676e8fa38d3c7efecadac65de68386ecbed\nparent 9483ba16c9dd2ae0b9c1cf67d261fece5fd4311b\nauthor Maxime Bergeron <pmmaster2020@gmail.com> 1790858821 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790858821 -0400\n\nbug(BILL-CPC-1878): Fix current Archive and Pagination Function (#1521)\n\n**JIRA:** [link to jira\nticket](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1878?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiY2I0N2QyNWVlZWQ5NDg2NWEwODgwNzA1MjU1ZjNiOTYiLCJwIjoiaiJ9)\n## Context:\nThis ticket fixes the BILL archive and pagination behavior.\nPreviously, archived bills could be removed after pagination had already\nhappened, which could cause a page that should display 10 bills to show\nfewer than 10 visible bills.\nThe page count could also include archived bills even when archived\nbills were hidden.\nThis change makes the archive option part of the pagination request so\nthat visible bills are filtered before pagination and counted correctly.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo it does not\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\n\n- Updated BillServiceClient.java to forward the includeArchived\nparameter for pagination and bill count requests.\n- Updated BillController.java in the API Gateway V2 layer to accept\nincludeArchived and pass it to BillServiceClient.\n- Updated BillService.java to add overloads for pagination and count\nmethods that support includeArchived.\n- Updated BillServiceImpl.java to filter archived bills before\npagination and to count bills using the same archive setting.\n- Updated BillController.java in the billing service to accept\nincludeArchived, apply default page/size values, and forward the archive\nsetting to the service layer.\n- Updated getAllBillsPaginated.tsx to send includeArchived with\npaginated BILL requests.\n- Updated useGetAllBillsPaginated.ts to accept and forward the\nincludeArchived value.\n- Updated AdminBillsListTable.tsx to connect the Show Archived / Hide\nArchived option to backend pagination and reset to the first page when\narchive visibility changes.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nYes\nThe existing paginated BILL frontend request already used the V2 API\nthrough \"useV2: true\" before CPC-1878.\nThis ticket did not introduce the V2 endpoint. It only extends the\nexisting BILL pagination flow by passing the optional \"includeArchived\"\nquery parameter\nThe \"includeArchived\" parameter itself is backwards compatible.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore changes, no pagination without archived bills:\n<img width=\"1847\" height=\"1002\" alt=\"bug-cpc-1878-before-unpaginated\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/66ba8f98-caf0-4a0b-becd-916b009cbeac\"\n/>\n\nAfter changes, pagination with and without archived bills (max 10 bills\nper page):\n<img width=\"1845\" height=\"1002\" alt=\"bug-cpc-1878-after-zoomed_out\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/62f3d836-2893-4522-b7a6-3b173a8732a5\"\n/>\n\n\n## Dev notes\nWhile finishing my tests, I realized that the filtering function wasn''t\naffected when fixing pagination. Will need to create a new ticket for\nfixing filtering in general.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Arushi Naik <arushi.a.naik@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvlZFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvMgQADEp10Hdsyu2khmDIRRSR8Py\ns6PEkSDBxOrfoLeVXPJPKF31bjGsa/o/Gh0vSgmEJhJpXn/rOJJQJIUIsOrD0gpi\nYmTc8SENMHFdX9yZw6LbNP5075RSE4AmR8UnmlCfh/zU7ys9Bqz+a5s08pEOa1bJ\nWc2xHrq1PgKfzkWwMi5mvrz4gn+tvf4aYgXIq7hAf1GneVvsn9XXV2WEVQSVtDNs\nmxEBb0CF5tF/Ycj+17AQhd+oRIO0sXZOTWBD7h0Srf4Bm1Yz5yVlm9lIJ7HFlM+T\nEBekZ88RneayHSkdhweCyoEmMWKX+xPFWOnaUZGsm2atHYESq7bVp4fmG9C0ovyA\n+9JLwG3K7xnhC6F4pmWeJupqXu1SnbBMrSduhK3sU3KfsxkKAJmAQt2B9PsabWCb\ncJSwlbv8iKrvY6629E6coxkHSX6m5fsaETf75cYlhcwLLBbjI4mjOzDyHlS71L/l\nmOWhIblwE13KX6gaP2q89nZUHHPNyKLfdR7s2u2Wo99JwyYmIJ55RY/JlzMBjjkM\ndexUl9oQiXF4dGjlYdS6LWrUmJjz3Fx8jyWyBmBrKAc1DGi5/YhrHFsHw+9crDaZ\n+JBHCSNXiFNLJCqme7Er2DfleruqWA1zhFXsSZhazju0AzvaB7xX5/UJ/HmGt3z9\n06lQPg3FIz7X9H66OSC9\n=Yzk2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T12:47:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"h