s/marwamesk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marwamesk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marwamesk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/33c8a879f995559945adce5d436e1af17ec67b34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T23:33:09Z","email":"maroumes12@hotmail.com","name":"marwamesk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T23:33:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat/(VIST-CPC-1936)view and manage visit details (#1543)\n\n**JIRA:** [CPC-1936](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1936)\n\n## **Context:**\n\nCurrently, pet owners can see their visits in the MY Visits list, but\nthey cannot select a visit to access its complete details or manage the\nappointment. The visit details page should allow the owner to view the\nappointment information and view available actions, such as cancelling\nthe visit.\n\n## **Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:**\n\nNo\n\n## **Changes**\n\n- Made the Visit ID in the **VisitListTable.tsx** table a link that\nredirects to the **VisitByVisitId.tsx** page.\n- Changed the CSS of the Visit Details page.\n- Changed the **Return to Visits** button to redirect to the list of\nvisits.\n- Added the cancel button functionality in **VisitByVisitId.tsx**\n- Made sure the cancel button is only displayed when the visit status is\nUPCOMING or CONFIRMED\n- Changed the CANCELLED status color to red.\n- Added end-to-end tests for **CancelButtonChangesStatus ,**\n**CancelButtonVisibility**, and **visitDetailsTest**\n\n## **Does this use the v2 API?:**\n\nNo.\n\n## **Does this add a new communication between services?:**\n\nNo\n\n## **Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)**\n\nThis PR changes the UI of the customer portal by making the Visit ID in\nthe visit table a link that redirects to the visit details page, which\nalso displays a cancel button when applicable.\n\nBefore UI Change\n<img width=\"1461\" height=\"769\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-30 at 18 59 20\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2bd106dc-ebde-4a98-aba2-8adf6f184e80\"\n/>\n\n\nAfter UI change\n<img width=\"1501\" height=\"826\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-30 at 19 13 43\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1edac41-a73d-4889-8a6a-0c503b9f9d48\"\n/>\n\nVisits page: \n<img width=\"1501\" height=\"826\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-30 at 19 14 44\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1a8f7185-8b78-46db-9ccd-e8466ff4a2b8\"\n/>\n\n\n\n\n## **Dev notes (Optional)**\n\nThe following tests passed using playwright for end to end testing:\n\n- CancelButtonChangesStatus.spec.ts\n- CancelButtonVisibility.spec.ts\n- visitDetailsTest.spec.ts\n\n**3 PASSED**\n\n## **Linked pull requests (Optional)**\n\nNone","tree":{"sha":"7a3d04eeb0e03e9460a49da7d19778c8bef0f1e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/7a3d04eeb0e03e9460a49da7d19778c8bef0f1e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/33c8a879f995559945adce5d436e1af17ec67b34","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a3d04eeb0e03e9460a49da7d19778c8bef0f1e4\nparent ca24bea485f4e638a934c4352304379205fe0450\nauthor marwamesk <maroumes12@hotmail.com> 1790811189 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790811189 -0400\n\nfeat/(VIST-CPC-1936)view and manage visit details (#1543)\n\n**JIRA:** [CPC-1936](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1936)\n\n## **Context:**\n\nCurrently, pet owners can see their visits in the MY Visits list, but\nthey cannot select a visit to access its complete details or manage the\nappointment. The visit details page should allow the owner to view the\nappointment information and view available actions, such as cancelling\nthe visit.\n\n## **Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:**\n\nNo\n\n## **Changes**\n\n- Made the Visit ID in the **VisitListTable.tsx** table a link that\nredirects to the **VisitByVisitId.tsx** page.\n- Changed the CSS of the Visit Details page.\n- Changed the **Return to Visits** button to redirect to the list of\nvisits.\n- Added the cancel button functionality in **VisitByVisitId.tsx**\n- Made sure the cancel button is only displayed when the visit status is\nUPCOMING or CONFIRMED\n- Changed the CANCELLED status color to red.\n- Added end-to-end tests for **CancelButtonChangesStatus ,**\n**CancelButtonVisibility**, and **visitDetailsTest**\n\n## **Does this use the v2 API?:**\n\nNo.\n\n## **Does this add a new communication between services?:**\n\nNo\n\n## **Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)**\n\nThis PR changes the UI of the customer portal by making the Visit ID in\nthe visit table a link that redirects to the visit details page, which\nalso displays a cancel button when applicable.\n\nBefore UI Change\n<img width=\"1461\" height=\"769\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-30 at 18 59 20\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2bd106dc-ebde-4a98-aba2-8adf6f184e80\"\n/>\n\n\nAfter UI change\n<img width=\"1501\" height=\"826\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-30 at 19 13 43\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1edac41-a73d-4889-8a6a-0c503b9f9d48\"\n/>\n\nVisits page: \n<img width=\"1501\" height=\"826\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-30 at 19 14 44\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1a8f7185-8b78-46db-9ccd-e8466ff4a2b8\"\n/>\n\n\n\n\n## **Dev notes (Optional)**\n\nThe following tests passed using playwright for end to end testing:\n\n- CancelButtonChangesStatus.spec.ts\n- CancelButtonVisibility.spec.ts\n- visitDetailsTest.spec.ts\n\n**3 PASSED**\n\n## **Linked pull requests (Optional)**\n\nNone","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvZw1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAd2IQAE6u5KBia/pPi6USHVtuBP7E\nB3npt8V3MIN1fbpoEU1Q0YGLbUQMwxh6BrkdIXsNJFCQD1HOBqWSEzhtwdr+eCoX\n+7dPpBZF2uPO9xV8X