 photos.\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo.\nBe sure to include cgerard321 as a reviewer.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\n- Added the EN and FR buttons in the Nav bar, and it switches the\nlanguage to every page with translations setup.\n- Edited the translation json files in the customer profile for add pet\nphoto and customer photo.\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo.\n\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo, only did changes in the frontend.\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore, no button and only in english by default:\n<img width=\"1879\" height=\"933\" alt=\"Notranslation1\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f1d13a4-2a77-4128-a005-5579eefd4724\"\n/>\n<img width=\"692\" height=\"392\" alt=\"NoTranslation2\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a64c7d82-d0e9-4237-a123-01fcf20620dc\"\n/>\n<img width=\"701\" height=\"379\" alt=\"NoTranslation3\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/555b52fc-9d89-47de-a29b-3b325201bf90\"\n/>\n\nAfter, EN and FR buttons in the nav bar, and the pages are translated if\nFrench is selected, and by default is in English:\n<img width=\"1904\" height=\"950\" alt=\"YesTranslation\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a302f345-89c0-4a75-a5bb-a86ad4552628\"\n/>\n<img width=\"706\" height=\"369\" alt=\"YesTRanslationAnimal\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/89a06499-2de6-4ecb-be53-16f4fc45527e\"\n/>\n<img width=\"704\" height=\"382\" alt=\"YesTranslationProfile\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cc75fa81-044d-4f47-bd79-f10e8fd14f20\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nSpecific technical changes that should be noted\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nPull request links\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ORl0NN <olivierkhalil17@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Alexandra wintle <awintle@hotmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"58633077c5e1f11126b6e1556d14a4914ee4a6e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/58633077c5e1f11126b6e1556d14a4914ee4a6e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/ca24bea485f4e638a934c4352304379205fe0450","verification":{"payload":"tree 58633077c5e1f11126b6e1556d14a4914ee4a6e4\nparent af05f9cb5ddf5e60817f1d6229665d7e4232e332\nauthor Etienne Khalil <etienne.khalil09@gmail.com> 1790797976 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790797976 -0400\n\nfeat(CUST-CPC-1968): localize pet and profile photo upload (#1538)\n\n**JIRA:** link to jira ticket\n\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/14?selectedIssue=CPC-1968\n## Context:\nThis ticket implements the button for changing the language from English\nto French and vice versa, and adds translations for both adding pet\nphotos and profile photos.\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo.\nBe sure to include cgerard321 as a reviewer.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\n- Added the EN and FR buttons in the Nav bar, and it switches the\nlanguage to every page with translations setup.\n- Edited the translation json files in the customer profile for add pet\nphoto and customer photo.\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo.\n\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo, only did changes in the frontend.\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore, no button and only in english by default:\n<img width=\"1879\" height=\"933\" alt=\"Notranslation1\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f1d13a4-2a77-4128-a005-5579eefd4724\"\n/>\n<img width=\"692\" height=\"392\" alt=\"NoTranslation2\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachmen