users/Jesse023-1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/aea0486544831d4587a5d037b5255c26c23ad0e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T07:01:50Z","email":"JDizon@stu.champlaincollege.qc.ca","name":"Jesse John Dizon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T07:01:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"bug(BILL-CPC-2035): update customer service client url based on renamed CUST endpoint (#1531)\n\n**JIRA:** \n\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/15/backlog?selectedIssue=CPC-2035\n## Context:\nOn creating a bill, it would return ''404 Not Found'' on POST as it could\nnot find an existing customerId because of a change within the endpoint\nin CUST, this change is to update the CustomerServiceClient in\nbilling-service to reflect changes from CUST endpoint.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo, it does not.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\nChanged the `OwnerClient`  to `CustomerServiceClient`\nChanged any `ownerId` to `customerId`\nUpdated the tests in `CustomerServiceClientUnitTest` to reflect the\nchanges\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo, it does not\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo, it merely fixes the communication between BILL and CUST\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nNot applicable\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)","tree":{"sha":"01b09ef8eb3f0e0e261f188e2fa978b2c3f75c39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/01b09ef8eb3f0e0e261f188e2fa978b2c3f75c39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/aea0486544831d4587a5d037b5255c26c23ad0e3","verification":{"payload":"tree 01b09ef8eb3f0e0e261f188e2fa978b2c3f75c39\nparent 7fb6e3f9a9e28c01c6c2489c9e6ca86ea5f78afc\nauthor Jesse John Dizon <JDizon@stu.champlaincollege.qc.ca> 1790751710 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790751710 -0400\n\nbug(BILL-CPC-2035): update customer service client url based on renamed CUST endpoint (#1531)\n\n**JIRA:** \n\nhttps://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/jira/software/c/projects/CPC/boards/15/backlog?selectedIssue=CPC-2035\n## Context:\nOn creating a bill, it would return ''404 Not Found'' on POST as it could\nnot find an existing customerId because of a change within the endpoint\nin CUST, this change is to update the CustomerServiceClient in\nbilling-service to reflect changes from CUST endpoint.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo, it does not.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\nChanged the `OwnerClient`  to `CustomerServiceClient`\nChanged any `ownerId` to `customerId`\nUpdated the tests in `CustomerServiceClientUnitTest` to reflect the\nchanges\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo, it does not\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo, it merely fixes the communication between BILL and CUST\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nNot applicable\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvLPeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgwYQAJY6beBKSPtSLBi736VdMwjJ\nZrMURq05chZZcz/C/gz+N++9RQPAsvlLLANF/1si9vhJ0XetySDiZtItO18TXUKp\ncUsDchBPCIBQ63+kuhLuo0tm+GFpdkqaSipLuoZohh+XrljdPQlS8mD8vH/1NNTm\nCf7/uBDoZpa1LtTf18mjNbEwg1nJwa0qDkxFPz0jHLbwUnOdR8F+aoId+GoKQJ4u\nOKX946HsUJsKrhuvjC7DxGymORaYhU5W2DemWeoqIoVGBLDCNr1aA6cnSbyzOLJt\nt77IQMeA+/QG40YCiUBZpOrtybHkILlu0O3coLzWgRPrprPZNDfsm7g9VaNV22Ym\nKEPYJusPEYsFr+syybpEKebzOEpSCnbNg8AZpsY2RXJ371jPvs+L7z+2ChjKGk1k\npayWUwaRcMCHOnOnGSZ4zba