4 L2.\n\n**N/A**\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nIf this is a change to the UI, include before and after screenshots to\nshow the differences.\nIf this is a new UI feature, include screenshots to show reviewers what\nit looks like.\n\n**N/A**","tree":{"sha":"c89f318bbb5e0872316d1c84f930e94e9e4fbabf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/c89f318bbb5e0872316d1c84f930e94e9e4fbabf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/eb61738fffffbe283edeb285cb8d3a5be8e1dd91","verification":{"payload":"tree c89f318bbb5e0872316d1c84f930e94e9e4fbabf\nparent e4c77508de9d6514f7b255b267b0d94db41a8c01\nauthor Youcef <youcef68001@gmail.com> 1790619597 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790619597 -0400\n\nbug(CART-CPC-1946): removed duplicate function and fixed reference (#1512)\n\n**JIRA:** https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1946\n## Context:\nWhat is the ticket about and why are we doing this change.\n\nThere was 2 different classes that calculate subtotal and they both do\nit differently for some reason, so we needed to remove the one that was\nunused and verify that the one that is used has null-checks, taxes,\npromos, etc...\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nIf the PR changes the .vscode folder, explain why in detail because it\nshould not.\nBe sure to include cgerard321 as a reviewer.\n\n**N/A**\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\n- Removed calculateTotal() as it was unused\n- Fixed its reference in checkoutCart to use the real total function\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nIf the PR uses the v2 API, explain why\n\n**N/A**\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nIf the PR adds a new communication between services, make sure to update\nthe C4 L2.\n\n**N/A**\n\n#