Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(INVT-CPC-1995): create dynamically changing inventory page (#1490)\n\n**JIRA:** [link to jira\nticket](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1995)\n## Context:\nThis tickets aims to add an inventory page that employees can access in\nthe dedicated portal. It was created as part of the migration from the\nold portal in React to the new portal in Angular.\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nThis PR does NOT change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\nAdded the \"inventory\" feature to the \"src/app/features\" folder\ncontaining :\n- The \"inventory\" model\n- The \"inventory-service\" service\n- The \"inventory-list\" page\n- \".spec.ts\" testing files for all of the above additions\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nThis pull request does not use the v2 API\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nThis pull request does not add communication between services\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nBefore:\n<img width=\"1918\" height=\"919\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/27da5341-a10d-4f1c-a1e7-1eb4a9ca6f64\"\n/>\n\nAfter:\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"919\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/45065ceb-b60b-49e3-aa8f-d9ca2fed9b1c\"\n/>\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\nInside of \"sidenav.ts\", I made \"items\" into a signal in accordance with\nAngular best practices\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Nic <101201789+nic5694@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Dylan Brassard <71225455+DylanBrass@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f718b8d9de3145a39bd3f5eb356d17c6ad2cb66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/1f718b8d9de3145a39bd3f5eb356d17c6ad