users/ArushiNaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArushiNaik","id":203453743,"login":"ArushiNaik","node_id":"U_kgDODCB1Lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArushiNaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/c824e160170bb642c3c65e963ca627265ff4da25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:49:56Z","email":"arushi.a.naik@gmail.com","name":"Arushi Naik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:49:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"bug(BILL-CPC-1513): Fix BillController Integration Test for payBill Endpoint (#1502)\n\n**JIRA:** https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1513\n\n## Context:\nThis ticket addresses the failing `payBill` integration tests in the API\nGateway. The tests were previously not working because the MockServer\nconfiguration did not correctly provide the required mocked responses\nfor the `payBill` endpoint. This change updates the mock configuration\nso the integration tests can properly test the expected scenarios.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo. This PR does not modify the `.vscode` folder in\n`petclinic-frontend`.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\n- Updated `CustomerBillControllerIntegrationTest` to use the appropriate\ncustomer token validation mock.\n- Added/configured the customer token validation endpoint in\n`MockServerConfigAuthService`.\n- Updated `MockServerConfigBillService` to correctly register the\n`payBill` endpoint.\n- Added a mocked success response for the `payBill` request.\n- Added a mocked `404 Customer not found` response for an invalid\ncustomer scenario.\n- Changes affect the `api-gateway` test configuration and integration\ntests only.\n- No production business logic was changed.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nYes. The integration test is located under the API Gateway v2\npresentation layer and tests the `CustomerBillController` v2 endpoint.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo. This PR does not introduce any new service-to-service communication.\nIt only updates existing MockServer configurations used by integration\ntests.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nNot applicable. This PR does not make any UI changes.\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nNone.","tree":{"sha":"3a991c4cb8dda322cc0dffd41e39164d6850dabe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/3a991c4cb8dda322cc0dffd41e39164d6850dabe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/c824e160170bb642c3c65e963ca627265ff4da25","verification":{"payload":"tree 3a991c4cb8dda322cc0dffd41e39164d6850dabe\nparent aa445a93c4017870c02393c26eea29b8297c9fca\nauthor Arushi Naik <arushi.a.naik@gmail.com> 1790614196 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790614196 -0400\n\nbug(BILL-CPC-1513): Fix BillController Integration Test for payBill Endpoint (#1502)\n\n**JIRA:** https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1513\n\n## Context:\nThis ticket addresses the failing `payBill` integration tests in the API\nGateway. The tests were previously not working because the MockServer\nconfiguration did not correctly provide the required mocked responses\nfor the `payBill` endpoint. This change updates the mock configuration\nso the integration tests can properly test the expected scenarios.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo. This PR does not modify the `.vscode` folder in\n`petclinic-frontend`.\n\n<span style=\"color:red\">**Reviewers need to check for any changes to the\n.vscode folder and add a comment about it to their review\ncomments.**</span>\n\n## Changes\n- Updated `CustomerBillControllerIntegrationTest` to use the appropriate\ncustomer token validation mock.\n- Added/configured the customer token validation endpoint in\n`MockServerConfigAuthService`.\n- Updated `MockServerConfigBillService` to correctly register the\n`payBill` endpoint.\n- Added a mocked success response for the `payBill` request.\n- Added a mocked `404 Customer not found` response for an invalid\ncustomer scenario.\n- Changes affect the `api-gateway` test configuration and integration\ntests only.\n- No production business logic was changed.\n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nYes. The integration test is located under the API Gateway v2\npresentation layer and tests the `CustomerBillController` v2 endpoint.\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo. This PR does not introduce any new service-to-service communication.\nIt only updates existing MockServer configurations used by integration\ntests.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nNot applicable. This PR does not make any UI changes.\n\n## Dev notes (Optional)\n\n## Linked pull requests (Optional)\nNone.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqupq0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA68YQAFb3zLB+RJ+ssrKKkT77ChIa\nbz22xB0C+ZRtSskEFwtG+NLNDYBrm8T1CP8MUlnHkmbdzM948L4pbKHw27gAV1yA\nVZWtvwpRGMk/vm6+/SY+vr6J5IJjdMIha4AYW6OSR0aVdJI5VGXsHLsYv5Fa7/rj\nJNCYBIAh/Pk2jL7bJy4lh5oGGSUgvcqAvIT3soQ1RAFb8Zf7GTdlLdu4IqIM6OWd\niHwCAGsCm5NLzg83ZkoJzfylUPhobr6rw5S+55QS0N7TLx5Y23E66JbdJY8uO2Fs\nshqXF77Zt267fWFKZBOKINz5y/QAaMaDo7mVFqi5UMUifO8NPeYjZyAlMiK0AmTj\nC+zZkEYBnZjgp2L3nDjl/kbw1mxoAYAS0ZKv4HInWmc00/PZVwhOZQTKD