tar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123912175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateDev5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateDev5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateDev5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateDev5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NateDev5","id":123912175,"login":"NateDev5","node_id":"U_kgDOB2K_7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateDev5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateDev5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateDev5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateDev5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateDev5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateDev5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/commits/aa445a93c4017870c02393c26eea29b8297c9fca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:40:05Z","email":"123912175+NateDev5@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nathan Bessette"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:40:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(PROD-CPC-1964) migrate from mongo db to postgres (#1494)\n\n**JIRA:** [link to jira\nticket](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1964)\n## Context:\nThe goal of this ticket was to transition away from MongoDB and use a\nbetter alternative which is Postgres in this case.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo this PR does not change the .vscode folder.\n\n## Changes\n- Modified all entities to use @Table instead of @Document\n- Repository are now using `R2dbcRepository` instead of\n`MongoReactiveRepository`\n- Added `schema.sql` to setup database\n- Modified `@Query` that used old mongo syntax to use proper postgresql\nsyntax\n- Added postgres testcontainer config for local dev\n- Created abstract class for postgres testcontainer to be used in tests \n- Removed all mongo dependencies & h2\n- Modified `docker-compose.yml` & `docker-compose.prod.yml` to use a new\ncontainer called *postgres-products* and removed the old\n*mongo-products* container\n- Modified the C4 L2 to reflect the migration \n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo, this PR does not use the v2 API\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo, this service only modified the existing `products-db`.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nThis PR does not affect the UI.\n\n## Dev notes\n- When running the product-service or the product-service tests locally\n**docker needs to be running** since both use testcontainers now.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dylan Brassard <71225455+DylanBrass@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dylanbrass <dylan.brassard@outlook.com>","tree":{"sha":"463f6da06b4d5aadc0efa123135c414045c192e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/463f6da06b4d5aadc0efa123135c414045c192e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/aa445a93c4017870c02393c26eea29b8297c9fca","verification":{"payload":"tree 463f6da06b4d5aadc0efa123135c414045c192e5\nparent 04c00fdcdcfa0d0a0fc53e5d9ad61d8c0a5bc4d4\nauthor Nathan Bessette <123912175+NateDev5@users.noreply.github.com> 1790613605 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790613605 +0000\n\nfeat(PROD-CPC-1964) migrate from mongo db to postgres (#1494)\n\n**JIRA:** [link to jira\nticket](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1964)\n## Context:\nThe goal of this ticket was to transition away from MongoDB and use a\nbetter alternative which is Postgres in this case.\n\n## Does this PR change the .vscode folder in petclinic-frontend?:\nNo this PR does not change the .vscode folder.\n\n## Changes\n- Modified all entities to use @Table instead of @Document\n- Repository are now using `R2dbcRepository` instead of\n`MongoReactiveRepository`\n- Added `schema.sql` to setup database\n- Modified `@Query` that used old mongo syntax to use proper postgresql\nsyntax\n- Added postgres testcontainer config for local dev\n- Created abstract class for postgres testcontainer to be used in tests \n- Removed all mongo dependencies & h2\n- Modified `docker-compose.yml` & `docker-compose.prod.yml` to use a new\ncontainer called *postgres-products* and removed the old\n*mongo-products* container\n- Modified the C4 L2 to reflect the migration \n\n## Does this use the v2 API?:\nNo, this PR does not use the v2 API\n\n## Does this add a new communication between services?:\nNo, this service only modified the existing `products-db`.\n\n## Before and After UI (Required for UI-impacting PRs)\nThis PR does not affect the UI.\n\n## Dev notes\n- When running the product-service or the product-service tests locally\n**docker needs to be running** since both use testcontainers now.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dylan Brassard <71225455+DylanBrass@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dylanbrass <dylan.brassard@outlook.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquphlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnRwQABXkJzhd9gw1se24eO9xCGeH\nq9jtH8m0O0nPlqb5mOSi35xuJ069cvflFB0Mz+p/pwYZ4FoeVy3+9aWWOOyLTou6\nCVHjDgh1+WmCBWw8wJrnMiVtTLxbMH9AkEFg4PgtZsYa4b9/GdbyLikOE2CCzcw+\nOsJYArm7tiNva3NPCLsTDF/xvzXZRwLAj6MSts4CcZMjBVrNPGOTnPyh+1h+k586\nX/obqeCXXN8ulvzuI4EqyhTF/siae6GKiXwm+wvjnDNTCVoFMLnOHIKeGW0UXVly\n1bIs8nJ/6ArcaAl0FVJdgdTZ27yi4N103z10YrxdqJIwTvSRPDTzmFpLxxcTXXwB\n4OVifhmneG/kMxszjY8RXgbaOk5ouyIG5TT7Cnxkd6QqKzBg6ocO+50PwrxWnpSZ\nwHTd1n1XMWJpMasFvQpFZnqnzdaRB1fGckuXoeixCiwfMvaA+j/Ke8yD14gUR5Ld\nQt2jyiA1v5JIL8LzvFzf0DQBdffErHm1zOUgrgKx9Exviqmmn/K3DzQWAqsU7k2/\nhgBiDYgsuyxAnQqDHri2r2tnd+EAsGZjHUChszhE3uLxchcyHBCKNgXCMp7a0O1f\nkN0CxDUFB0iRo47qNmlIEhL/TXi6vm1RyuNZLly/d8nFLUfGJSXeVmjAbVG+YhxO\n6sIITn+IJ/QPEQPRLtpG\n=G0m0\n----