\n\n**JIRA:** [link to jira\nticket](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1951)\n\n## Context:\nWhen doing an action in the customer portal, especially one''s that\nrefresh the page, a race condition would cause the user to be redirected\nto the 401 (and 403 if 401 was disabled).\n\nRevierwers:\n\nVIST: 2 reviewers (ticket owners) - full dev review\nINVT: 1 reviewer (steward) - steward review\nCUST: 1 reviewer (steward) - steward review\n\n## Changes\n- Added a wait for isLoading in useAuthRedirect and ProtectedRouteProps\n- Added a check to avoid infinite loops of redirect, now if the redirect\nis the same as the page, we do nothing.","tree":{"sha":"39fad097ce892d84e9c05f4504b0eedaff2ecc46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/trees/39fad097ce892d84e9c05f4504b0eedaff2ecc46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cgerard321/champlain_petclinic/git/commits/af8fe24aa2cb7e9945ea9878ce0abb1e4f14c29e","verification":{"payload":"tree 39fad097ce892d84e9c05f4504b0eedaff2ecc46\nparent e4e5a95a1f4c5dee0dee8181b3c51dd9bd961613\nauthor Dylan Brassard <71225455+DylanBrass@users.noreply.github.com> 1790277608 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790277608 -0400\n\nbug(CPC-1951): Add loading state to useAuthRedirect and ProtectedRouteProps hook (#1481)\n\n**JIRA:** [link to jira\nticket](https://champlainsaintlambert.atlassian.net/browse/CPC-1951)\n\n## Context:\nWhen doing an action in the customer portal, especially one''s that\nrefresh the page, a race condition would cause the user to be redirected\nto the 401 (and 403 if 401 was disabled).\n\nRevierwers:\n\nVIST: 2 reviewers (ticket owners) - full dev review\nINVT: 1 reviewer (steward) - steward review\nCUST: 1 reviewer (steward) - steward review\n\n## Changes\n- Added a wait for isLoading in useAuthRedirect and ProtectedRouteProps\n- Added a check to avoid infinite loops of redirect, now if the redirect\nis the same as the page, we do nothing.","reason":"valid","sign